&lt;li&gt;Integrate with customer infrastructure and verify end-to-end workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide concise field feedback that informs product priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a development team member when not traveling, applying your on-site knowledge to guide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implementation towards impactful outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
