&lt;li&gt;Strong C# skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with desktop/UI frameworks (WPF, Avalonia)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for robotics and industrial automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel at least 40%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with one or more of: robotics, machine vision, OpenGL, PLCs, or Modbus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C++ experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
