&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3897 - Senior Associate, AV&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EM handles the media planning and buying for some of the world&#39;s smartest advertisers.&amp;nbsp; Supported by keen consumer insight, analysis and experience, we are part of the largest media planning and buying network in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the only agency to simultaneously hold the title of Agency Network of the Year across all 5 of the industry’s biggest awards, whilst recently being named Campaign’s Media Agency of the Decade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a diligent buyer with at least one year of TV buying experience and has some knowledge across other AV channels such as Online Video, Addressable TV, OOH TV, Cinema and Radio, so they are equipped to work on one of the UK’s biggest and most forward-thinking advertisers – Tesco. There will also be opportunities to be involved in the planning across these channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience in TV buying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the UK TV marketplace, along with other AV media such as Radio, Cinema and VOD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail is key&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and be able to prioritise tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and enthusiasm to work on huge clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of industry media buying tools (all media e.g. BARB, Media Ocean, Caria, Prisma and Jet)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pro-actively forge relationships with media owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially astute and excellent negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and good communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and ability to build strong relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent numeracy skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all billings are accurate and all financial queries and issues are resolved in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicating booked plans to implementational planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driven &amp;amp; committed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi skilled in media buying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Operations Director is responsible for ensuring that solutions developed and released for the Solutions team are operationally ready, properly tested, clearly documented, effectively released, and provide support once live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role acts as the bridge between delivery, business readiness and BAU operations. It supports the transition of work from project delivery into stable operational use, ensuring that users, stakeholders and support teams understand what has changed, how to use it, how to raise issues, and how ongoing support will be managed with appropriate priority, impact and SLAs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is particularly important as Solutions Integration moves from a more reactive service model into a structured product and agile delivery function. The Platform Operations Director owns QA, release management, documentation, stakeholder communication, support processes, training, adoption and post-release improvement including BAU bugs and triage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role works closely with Product Owners, Scrum Master, Engineering, Data, Reporting, QA, Platform Operations, and business stakeholders to make sure delivery does not stop at “built”, but continues through testing, launch, adoption, support and measurable operational value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior / Specialist-Level Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Director within the team, this role is expected to help define and improve the operating standards around BAU management, QA coordination, release readiness, business readiness and service transition. Manage and proactively manage risk, resolution SLAs and ensure we are adhering to platform operational best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Operations Director should be able to identify operational risks early, challenge whether a solution is genuinely ready for release, and recommend practical improvements to processes, documentation, testing, support models and stakeholder communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For smaller initiatives, the role should be able to advise Product Owners and delivery teams on the appropriate level of QA, training, release planning, handover and BAU support required. For larger or more complex initiatives, the role should escalate risks, dependencies or readiness gaps to the Product Manager Lead, Scrum Master, Lead Engineer / Solutions Architect or relevant leadership stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. BAU Operations Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and coordinate BAU operational processes for assigned platforms, tools, reports, workflows and solutions across all Media solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor recurring issues, support trends, operational risks and user pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and prioritise BAU requests, incidents, defects and enhancement requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure BAU work is captured through the agreed intake and backlog process rather than unmanaged emails, verbal requests or fragmented ticket routes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Owners and the Scrum Master to distinguish between BAU support, defects, enhancements and new product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility of BAU demand and help identify where recurring issues should become product improvements or engineering fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support continuous improvement of support processes, documentation and operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This links directly to the team’s wider shift away from fragmented request routes and towards clearer delivery rhythms, structured backlogs and improved operational process discipline. The existing documentation notes the need for clearer team rhythms, sprint cadences, retrospectives and mentoring as part of the transition plan .&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. QA Coordination and Testing Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate QA activity across delivery workstreams, ensuring testing requirements are understood before development begins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Owners to ensure acceptance criteria, test scenarios and success measures are clearly defined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support test planning across functional testing, regression testing, data validation, reporting checks and user acceptance testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure defects are logged, prioritised, tracked and resolved through the agreed delivery process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineers, analysts and business users to validate that solutions meet functional, operational and reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the creation of reusable QA checklists, test scripts and validation templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions are not released without appropriate testing evidence and business sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is consistent with the Product Owner responsibilities already defined around testing requirements, success criteria, UAT coordination, business validation, release readiness and operational handover . The Platform Operations Specialist would support and operationalise those activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Business Readiness and Adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure business users and operational teams are ready to adopt new or changed solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate training, guidance, demos, FAQs, release notes and user communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Owners to identify impacted teams, users, processes and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confirm that business teams understand what is changing, why it is changing, when it is happening and what action is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support stakeholder communications before, during and after release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather early feedback from users and ensure issues are captured and prioritised appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure delivered solutions are embedded into day-to-day operations, rather than remaining underused or misunderstood.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The handover documentation highlights the importance of clear communication with users, proper release notes, demonstrations and adoption support for new features and solutions . This role should own the operational discipline around making that happen consistently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Release Readiness and Service Transition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own or coordinate release readiness checklists for assigned solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure each release has appropriate testing evidence, documentation, support ownership, training material and stakeholder communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate operational handover from delivery teams into BAU support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confirm that runbooks, troubleshooting guides, known issues and escalation routes are in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering and data teams to ensure monitoring, alerting or manual checks are defined where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support go-live planning, release scheduling and post-release hypercare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track post-release issues and ensure learnings are fed back into future delivery cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role should become the person asking:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Are we actually ready to put this live, support it, explain it, and measure whether it worked?”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Documentation and Knowledge Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear operational documentation for platforms, reports, tools, processes and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the creation of user guides, SOPs, runbooks, release notes, FAQs and support documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure documentation is stored in the agreed location and kept up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Owners, engineers and analysts to document key dependencies, business rules, known limitations and support processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce reliance on individual knowledge by making processes and system behaviour transparent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding of new team members by maintaining accessible knowledge resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is important because the team is moving away from legacy ways of working and informal knowledge transfer into a more structured operating model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. Platform and Process Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the consistent use of agreed tools, workflows, ticketing processes and delivery governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure work is captured, categorised and progressed through the correct routes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain standards for BAU tickets, defects, release requests, support issues and operational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process gaps, duplicated effort or inconsistent ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend improvements to BAU processes, support models, QA standards and release governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reporting on operational performance, support demand, defect trends and release readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure changes are controlled, documented and aligned to agreed team practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This aligns with the documented need to improve proactive behaviour, structured product management, backlog grooming, stand-ups and retrospectives across the team .&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. Stakeholder and Cross-Team Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product Owners, Engineering, Data, Reporting, QA, Scrum Master and business users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Activation, Operations, Channel Development, Commercial and other impacted teams where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure operational dependencies are understood and managed before release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help stakeholders understand support routes, known issues, timelines and release impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate operational risks, unresolved defects, readiness gaps or business adoption concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regular BAU and platform operations updates for leadership where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The existing Product Owner documentation already describes the importance of coordination across engineering, data, reporting, platform, operations and business teams . The Platform Operations Specialist should provide the operational control layer that supports this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in platform operations, service transition, QA coordination, business readiness, delivery operations or technical operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of BAU support processes, release management and operational handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating UAT, defect tracking, test planning or business validation activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create clear documentation, user guides, process notes, release communications and operational runbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with the ability to work across technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of agile or product-led delivery environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify operational risks, readiness gaps, support issues and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using Jira, Confluence, ServiceNow, Azure DevOps or similar delivery/support tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate clearly with users, delivery teams and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in media, advertising, ad tech, martech, reporting, data or platform environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting reporting platforms, dashboards, data products or operational workflow tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data validation, reporting QA or campaign performance data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud-based platforms such as GCP, AWS, BigQuery or Snowflake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with engineering, data engineering or analytics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting transformation from reactive support models into structured product or agile delivery models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with WPP, WPP Media, Choreograph or similar enterprise platform environments would be beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Manager is the most senior PM role in the Development team and shapes and drives the strategic direction of products, platforms, and capabilities across WPP Media Solutions. The role works across business, technology, data, and operations to ensure priorities are understood, delivery is aligned to business objectives, and strategic initiatives can be executed effectively at scale. The Product Manager is accountable for product direction, stakeholder alignment, roadmap management, and supporting a connected, scalable, product-led delivery model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Manager is the direct manager and functional lead for Product Owners, supporting their development, alignment, delivery effectiveness, and adoption of consistent product and agile practices. The role provides regular updates on roadmap progress, risks, dependencies, and strategic opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and roadmap leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain product roadmaps aligned to business priorities, client outcomes, operational requirements, and strategic growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate leadership objectives into structured product initiatives and delivery plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term commercial priorities with long-term platform maturity, scalability, maintainability, and sustainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with wider WPP and Choreograph data, technology, and platform strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and client value alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions Design as well as Commercial, Activation, Planning, and Client Leadership teams to support scalable client growth and measurable business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape solutions that balance client ambition, operational practicality, commercial sustainability, and delivery feasibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve operational efficiency, transparency, automation, and client outcomes through product and platform evolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through influence across multiple teams and disciplines without direct ownership of delivery functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align business, operational, and technical teams around shared objectives and delivery momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate decisions across complex stakeholder groups with competing priorities, timelines, and pressures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the strategic escalation point for delivery, prioritisation, dependencies, and stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Owner leadership and team development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership, guidance, and line management to Product Owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Product Owners align to strategic priorities, roadmap objectives, governance standards, and delivery expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion agile and product-led working practices, including consistent documentation, definition-of-ready/definition-of-done, and backlog discipline across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Product Owner development, capability growth, and career progression through objective-setting and regular 1:1s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery and engineering liaison&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary interface between the Product Management function and the Engineering Lead/Solutions Architect, ensuring requirements are engineering-ready before entering delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the development cycle cadence in partnership with the Scrum Master (sprint/release planning, backlog grooming, capacity planning)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own overall user acceptance testing (UAT) governance across the team - standards, sign-off criteria, and escalation of failed UAT cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading a product management function for at least 8 years within a technical/engineering environment, ideally in adtech, martech, or data-driven media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a team of Product Owners or Product Managers, including performance management and development planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of agile delivery frameworks (Scrum/Kanban) and the mechanics of sprint/release planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate at both the strategic (roadmap, commercial alignment, stakeholder leadership) and tactical (requirements, UAT, backlog) level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management — able to lead through influence across teams with no direct delivery ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data infrastructure, reporting, automation/AI, or platform integration products is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working in a highly matrixed global to local organisation and comfortable managing external dependencies for deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Measures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roadmap delivery against committed timelines across all product verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistency and maturity of Product Owner practice (backlog quality, UAT pass rates, requirements traceability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Owner team retention, capability growth, and succession depth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder satisfaction (Design, Engineering, business) with requirements quality and delivery predictability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and own the ways of working for the solutions product owners to deliver the bigger picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3667 - Director, Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The planning team are the guardians of creating industry leading, unrivalled work at WPP Media. We are central conduits to all specialists, striving to push boundaries and have a positive impact on consumers and brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Planning &lt;/strong&gt;to join our growing planning team, to drive forward our planning output and help to create amazing work for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Planning Craft:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the WPP Media planning output on your specific client to create unrivalled work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to articulate the strategic approach into media behaviours and train and support the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Need strategic thinking on how we utilise tools and specialism outside of planning on response i.e. sources of growth, measurement, learning agenda, data, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build presence outside of current teams and drive visibility of planning team within the wider agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a fresh perspective to planning approaches including the use of different tools, new insights and coach others to challenge the status quo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall responsibility for the development of all planning responses, ensuring we are developing unrivalled work in all executions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead daily running of account ensuring all governances processes are adhered to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage senior client relationships, understanding what they need for their business and how to drive growth for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the planning team of three, ensuring the have clear personal objectives, structure and regular reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Idea creation and storytelling: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop relationship with media owners and look for opportunities to create unrivalled work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an advanced commercial understanding of WPP Media’s products and services. Understanding which are suitable for their clients and how sell in solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a story telling expert, driving added value with the team and quality boosting output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Area Knowledge – Advanced-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrates advanced understanding of the industry as well as future trends. Serves as an internal consultant/expert on at least some tools and technology. Effectively guides junior team members on advanced elements. Works with leadership team to develop new solutions and/or spot new applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving – Advanced -&lt;/strong&gt; Performs complex analyses of a range of information and identifies issues before they become problems; helps others think about how to define or redefine complex problems. Supports business leaders to find solutions and evaluates others’ solutions to determine the best way forward. Understand how to resolve escalated issues and coaches others to problem solve. Manages escalations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management – Advanced -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Capitalizes on deep understanding of (current or potential) client and agency organisational structures, business processes, strategic objectives and challenges in order to anticipate and meet their needs. Demonstrates expert knowledge and monitors the client’s industry in order to create effective solutions. Advises key stakeholders by continuously helping them to successfully navigate through critical business changes.​​​​​​​ Uses strong deep expertise and contextual awareness to explore complex issues with stakeholders and provide trusted advice, deliverables and campaign KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communication – Advanced -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Leads the delivery of relevant and accurate information to drive maximum impact. Consistently delivers communications to influence and educate all levels of seniority, appropriately judging the demands of the situation. Creatively develops presentations and comms to help with the understanding/education of complex information. Guides others on the best practices and approaches for creating clear, concise and organized communication materials to convey plans in a user-friendly way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Management – Expert -&lt;/strong&gt; Sets the standard for accuracy and thoroughness so that sufficiently detailed information is logged correctly.&amp;nbsp; Balances short-term considerations with long-term goals and ensures that critical deliverables are met.&amp;nbsp; Manages multiple overlapping timelines and competing demands, weighing the needs of different stakeholders across the business to determine priorities for parallel projects and sets priorities according to business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compelling storytelling – Advanced -&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and direct the creation of a story, taking into account client knowledge levels and needs. Applies deep expertise and sound judgement to persuade key decision makers on recommendation, considering all implications. Designs differentiated communications (content focus, style, presentation, etc.) for various internal and external audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideas Creation – Expert -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Develops strategies to bring new technologies, innovations and products to life.&amp;nbsp; Challenges the client and team in innovating and designing new solutions, methods and products to remain competitive and lead the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comms Planning – Advanced -&lt;/strong&gt; High technical knowledge of all media touchpoints as well as how they interplay and future trends.&amp;nbsp; Serves as a consultant and quality controls plans, strategies and frameworks that leave the building.&amp;nbsp; Strategic learnings and insights about business impact (not just media metrics).&amp;nbsp; Development of directional media strategy/platform.&amp;nbsp; Developing comms planning skills amongst wider community.&amp;nbsp; Looks for alternative solutions to problems and constantly challenges received norms in a spirit of positive provocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3710 - Director, Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Strategy Director for OpenConnect, you will be the driving force behind the strategic comms planning output across BT Group’s complete brand portfolio, spanning consumer powerhouses (EE, BT, Plusnet) and BT Business. Reporting directly to the VP/Head of Strategy &amp;amp; Comms Planning, you will take operational charge of the planning floor, transforming upstream business logic into world-class, insight-led comms strategies that inspire both creative agency partners and senior client marketers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is purpose-built to transform our day-to-day strategic craft. Historically, our challenge has been moving beyond tactical execution, mechanical planning, and dense data slides. Your mandate is to revolutionise our narrative storytelling, unearth genuinely motivating human and cultural insights, and package complex strategies into crisp, executive-ready presentations that command authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting at the intersection of media, data, and creative, you will ensure our strategies are not just written, but deployed, partnering seamlessly with creative agencies across the BT Group roster to deliver unified, culture-shaping work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevating the Strategic Output&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the Comms Output: Take direct ownership of the quality, consistency, and rigour of all comms planning deliverables emerging from the planning cohort across EE, BT, Plusnet, and BT Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;From Information to Insight: Move the team away from surface-level observations and data dumping. Unearth sharp, tension-led insights (category, cultural, consumer, and company) that unlock unexpected media behaviors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 1 Architecture: Translate Stage 0 portfolio growth strategies into clear, actionable comms ecosystems, defining distinct role-for-channel tasks, full-funnel journeys, and Get/To/By frameworks that guide activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Applied Strategy Mandate: Champion applied discipline over theoretical deck-building. Ensure strategies actively steer media channel choices, investment weights, and creative formats (&quot;If our strategy isn’t actionable, it’s useless&quot;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Packaging &amp;amp; Narrative Storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rewriting the Narrative: Radically elevate the standard of strategic storytelling across the team. Replace tactical, jargon-heavy decks with compelling, commercially grounded narratives that captivate marketing directors and executive leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Packaging: Master the art of the synthesis. Package complex media systems, technical mechanics, and multi-brand nuances into succinct, punchy, C-suite ready narratives that clearly articulate the &quot;So What?&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visual &amp;amp; Verbal Clarity: Coach the planning cohort on visual layout, storyline momentum, and presentation delivery, setting a new benchmark for what an OpenConnect strategic deliverable looks and feels like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Agency Partnership &amp;amp; Ecosystem Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inter-Agency Roster Leadership: Act as a strategic partner to creative and BT strategists across the BT Group roster. Build collaborative, high-trust working relationships that dismantle agency silos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upstream Creative Collaboration: Where possible, engage early in the creative development cycle to influence ideation, ensuring creative platforms and media channel architectures complement, push, and amplify each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge the Creative/Media Divide: Serve as the connective tissue between creative ambition and media capability, co-developing unified campaign playbooks where media environments make the creative idea unmissable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Brand &amp;amp; Enterprise Breadth (Consumer + B2B)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumer Portfolio Rigour: Maintain clear distinction, tone, and strategic guardrails across consumer brands, ensuring EE, BT, and Plusnet execute with distinct roles without internal friction or audience overlap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BT Business Acceleration: Partner with the enterprise leads to bring consumer-grade storytelling, behavioural insight, and dynamic comms planning into the B2B space (SMEs, Corporate, and Public Sector).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Pollination: Identify shared learnings, testing frameworks, and effectiveness benchmarks across consumer campaigns and adapt them strategically for BT Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Upskilling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arms around the team: Actively mentor, manage, and coach planners in the team, transforming them from reactive brief-takers into proactive strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support on comms planning culture within the Open Connect team, bringing planners together in weekly council sessions, leading stretch sessions, training etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed Best Practice: Institutionalise consistent comms planning toolkits, framing templates, and insight-mining methodologies across the entire account team; get them using the data at our fingertips, always looking beyond TGI!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instill Strategic Confidence: Build a team culture anchored in conviction, strategic bravery, and clear point-of-view, empowering planners to defend ideas and challenge client briefs with commercial intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Comms Planning clout:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in senior Comms Strategy/planning, Connections Planning, or Integrated Strategy roles within top-tier media or creative agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Storyteller&lt;/strong&gt;: Exceptional ability to distill messy, highly technical, and data-dense inputs into elegant, high-impact stories tailored for CMOs and Marketing Directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight Hunter&lt;/strong&gt;: Demonstrated ability to find provocative, emotionally resonant human truths and cultural tensions that unlock fresh creative media solutions, not just reporting what the data says, but proving why it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: Experienced working alongside top creative agency strategy leads, with the diplomacy, creative vocabulary, and collaborative skill to shape work jointly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2C &amp;amp; B2B Versatility:&lt;/strong&gt; Consumer comms experience combined with the intellectual curiosity and agility to tackle the complex, account-based nuances of BT Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Player: &lt;/strong&gt;Natural mentor who loves developing planners, raising team morale through their positivity, enthusiasm and energy, to support building an environment of strategic excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2565 - Digital Associate Director, Media Planning, Global Client Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The role:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Account Director (Digital Planning &amp;amp; Activation)&lt;/strong&gt; is a senior client leadership role responsible for overseeing &lt;strong&gt;digital media planning and activation delivery for Electronic Arts (EA)&lt;/strong&gt; across biddable and platform‑led channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role operates at the centre of EA’s &lt;strong&gt;hub‑and‑spoke delivery model&lt;/strong&gt;, working closely with &lt;strong&gt;central planning and activation teams&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;local market teams&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure digital strategies are planned holistically and activated consistently across markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends &lt;strong&gt;digital planning leadership, activation governance, and client partnership&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring EA’s objectives are translated into effective digital plans and best‑in‑class execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope of Channels (Digital‑First)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Director is accountable for &lt;strong&gt;digital planning and activation leadership&lt;/strong&gt; across:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmatic Display &amp;amp; Video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online Video &amp;amp; CTV&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Social&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSP‑ and platform‑led digital media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data‑ and audience‑driven digital planning and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Planning Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;digital media planning oversight&lt;/strong&gt; across EA scopes, ensuring plans are:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically sound&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligned to EA business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feasible for activation across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with central planning teams to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape digital channel strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define budget allocation and channel roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align planning outputs with activation realities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure digital planning considerations are clearly communicated and understood by local markets and activation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Activation Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own senior oversight of &lt;strong&gt;digital activation delivery&lt;/strong&gt; across EA markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure digital plans are translated into &lt;strong&gt;clear, executable activation frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign structure, activation logic, timelines, and delivery quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as senior escalation point for &lt;strong&gt;digital delivery, performance, or operational risks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure digital best practices and governance standards are applied consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Central &amp;amp; Local Market Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the &lt;strong&gt;primary bridge between central teams and local markets&lt;/strong&gt; for digital planning and activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with central planning and activation leadership to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define digital frameworks and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain consistency across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local markets to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align global and regional digital strategies to local market requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support planning interpretation and activation feasibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure local insights and constraints inform both planning and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance global consistency with local flexibility across digital activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Partnership &amp;amp; Digital Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a &lt;strong&gt;trusted senior digital planning and activation partner&lt;/strong&gt; to EA stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead digital discussions across:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy and planning alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activation approach and platform selection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance, optimisation, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate digital trade‑offs, constraints, and opportunities to EA clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support test‑and‑learn and optimisation frameworks across planning and activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance, Measurement &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure digital plans and activation deliver against EA KPIs and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of pacing, optimisation priorities, and delivery performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with measurement and analytics teams to ensure:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital reporting clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent performance interpretation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure governance is maintained across platforms, partners, and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Operational Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own commercial accountability across &lt;strong&gt;digital planning and activation scopes&lt;/strong&gt;, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PO management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance process adherence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting and cost control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with finance and operations teams to ensure:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurate billing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent financial management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment between planning assumptions and activation delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business cases and staffing justification linked to digital delivery needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior leadership across digital planning and activation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity on ownership, responsibilities, and decision‑making within a matrixed model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support capability development in digital planning and activation best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion EA digital ways of working across central and local teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a &lt;strong&gt;digital planning and activation leadership role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;digital media planning and biddable activation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing &lt;strong&gt;complex, multi‑market digital scopes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and operational leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;global entertainment, gaming, or technology clients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating within &lt;strong&gt;hub‑and‑spoke or global/regional delivery models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with platform‑heavy and performance‑led digital environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Behaviours&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic yet delivery‑focused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm and credible under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially rigorous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and pragmatic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident decision‑maker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports into: Senior Client / Business Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key stakeholders:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EA global, regional, and market teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central digital planning and activation leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local market planning and activation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance, operations, and platform partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3072 - Associate Director, Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting for an Account Director who is an exceptional and driven media planner, to join our Connections Planning team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We foster a highly collaborative environment with brilliant, forward-thinking clients who are not only engaged but genuinely enthusiastic about pushing boundaries. This partnership allows us to deliver truly exciting, market-leading work that sets industry benchmarks and drives significant impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expect a role that is highly strategic, requiring deep analytical thinking, a keen commercial eye, and a flair for innovative solutions. We are consistently exploring new technologies, channels, and audience engagement models, ensuring your work remains at the cutting edge. Innovation is not just encouraged, it&#39;s expected.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, you&#39;ll have seamless access to a rich tapestry of agency expertise. You&#39;ll collaborate daily with our specialist teams in data science, advanced measurement &amp;amp; analytics, brand strategy, and consumer insights. This integrated approach empowers you to craft media plans that are not only creative and impactful but also deeply informed, measurable, and strategically sound.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About the role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be expected to demonstrate experience and knowledge in -&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowing the tools and means to build and target audiences in addressable and non-addressable media to validate the media approach ensuring that the defined audience can be reached at the scale required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing an approach that outlines how and where we will connect with defined audiences – especially hard to reach / low media engagement audiences – in media for brand and performance campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connecting the dots between the data we, the client, media owners and other internal teams hold to plan most effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing the connections ecosystem &amp;amp; plan, working closely and collaboratively with channel specialists and wider agency teams from a paid, owned and earned perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day to day management of campaigns and annual planning as a key liaison between clients and channel specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing measurement &amp;amp; testing framework to inform as well as measure and optimise the campaigns when live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management of others to develop their skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You show a breadth of understanding of all media channels and can confidently discuss the role they play within a comms strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in both brand and performance campaigns with some knowledge of ecommerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a tool ‘wizard’...well not quite but excellent knowledge of audience research and planning tools (e.g. TGI &amp;amp; Touchpoints) is a must and awareness of / familiarity with alternative sources (such as media owner tools &amp;amp; data) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to draw clear insights and implications for media (i.e. connecting the outputs of different insight systems successfully)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a passion for media and understanding of what makes a great media campaign, tangibly showcasing excellence in planning craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for the upfront work that needs to happen in order to deliver a great, clear and concise universal brief to the specialist teams that hits the clients&#39; brief on the head&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about proving your campaigns work! How? By being able to create a holistic measurement framework relevant for your brand and applicable to every campaign that is digestible (setting KPI’s methods I.e., which tool/system, necessary tracking) and plan for adaptation/optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are confident in presenting with passion and conviction, managing senior client relationships, running all agency team sessions and collaboratively leading client projects and tackling challenging conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited to work as part of a team; immediate, wider department and specialists as required. Leading by example though presence and contribution. Taking the responsibility for working in a collaborative, inclusive way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate excellent attention to detail and accuracy in output and meeting deadlines. As well as strong organization to meet client expectations, manage workflow for self and junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a proactive desire to continually improve own knowledge and wider skill set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are open minded, flexible and have a challenger mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
