&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help the Firefox DOM Core team improve the health of the Session History area. You will write tests to improve the coverage; you will fix tests and/or problems to improve the Gecko correctness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write Web-Platform tests to improve the coverage, and Gecko mochitests as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fix the problems and pass the tests to improve the Gecko correctness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work through code review with the relevant Gecko module owners and iterate to landing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Definition of done&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improved Session History test coverage and code correctness in Gecko, measured by passed test cases, allowing the team’s senior engineers to focus on security, performance and strategic projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in a browser-engine codebase or in automating for a browser-engine, ideally Firefox/Gecko.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid Javascript and applying that language skill to write automated tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in and experience developing software in C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong debugging skills in a mature larget codebase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort working in the open: public bugs, code review, and upstream landing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior contributions to Gecko or another major browser engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with web standards and Web Platform Tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help the Firefox DOM LWS team to implement tasks for Storage Encryption everywhere, helping to drive the in-progress project through to completion .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contributing to delivering Storage Encryption Everywhere in Gecko, which may include tasks such as migrating data between schemas, implementing data storage in PBM and integration testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write and pass Web Platform Tests, and add Gecko tests as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work through code review with the relevant Gecko module owners and iterate to landing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Surface and help resolve any specification questions the implementation raises.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Shepherd the feature through Nightly, Beta, and Release. Fix correctness, performance issues and regressions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Definition of done&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ship Storage Encryption Everywhere to release channel. Fix triaged and prioritized issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in a browser-engine codebase, ideally Firefox/Gecko.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in databases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with web standards and Web Platform Tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong debugging and optimization in a multithreaded codebase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort working in the open: public bugs, code review, and upstream landing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior contributions to Gecko or another major browser engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the relevant standards body and specification process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help reduce Firefox’s WebCompat bug backlog by finishing or verifying the diagnosis of the long tail of site-breakage bugs, and by writing interventions or simple fixes (often with AI assistance). You turn a large queue of reported breakages into diagnosed, actionable, or fixed bugs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Finish diagnosing, or verify the diagnosis of, long-tail WebCompat bugs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write WebCompat interventions where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write simple fixes (AI-assisted) and land them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reproduce and triage incoming site-breakage reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid web development (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and comfort debugging real-world site breakage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fluent with browser devtools and cross-browser diagnosis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfortable using AI tooling to speed up diagnosis and fixes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Gecko knowledge is a strong plus (but can be taught).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior WebCompat or web-standards experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Gecko platform is the core engine of our product experience. To maintain competitiveness and user satisfaction, we must move beyond surface-level metrics to understand the deep correlations between engine performance and real-world user behavior. We currently face challenges with data quality, such as bot contamination in nightly telemetry, which obscures our understanding of true performance trends. A dedicated analyst is required to bridge the gap between engineering telemetry and actionable product strategy, ensuring that leadership has high-fidelity data to prioritize performance guardrails and technical budgets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Deliverables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automated Dashboards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Create and maintain high-level overview dashboards that translate complex performance data into consumable formats for Product Managers and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Telemetry Gap Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Audit the Gecko codebase to identify missing collection points or &quot;probes&quot; necessary for a complete understanding of the product experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Sanitization Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Develop methodologies and tools to identify and filter data inconsistencies, specifically focusing on isolating bot traffic and hardware-specific noise from telemetry streams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behavioral Inference Reports:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Deliver deep-dive analyses correlating technical performance shifts (e.g., LCP, eTLD+1) with user-facing pain points and engagement trends.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope, Skills, and Effort Estimate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The analyst will focus exclusively on Gecko engine telemetry across multiple platforms (Desktop and Android), collaborating with the Performance Team, Data Team, and Product Leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Advanced SQL (BigQuery/Redash), proficiency in data visualization using AI tooling, and experience with statistical analysis (e.g., Pearson’s correlation, multivariate analysis). Knowledge of Rust/C++ is a strong plus. Strong proficiency with AI tools like Claude Code, Codex, or similar is highly desirable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Ability to understand browser component interactions and their impact on user experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Proven ability to work independently, translating technical requirements into business insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent problem solving:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Comfortable working in unfamiliar technical problem spaces and figuring out a path forward with minimal guidance, using documentation, experimentation, source code, data, and other available resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Tier 1 Locations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$93,450&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$124,600 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Tier 2 Locations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$84,600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$112,800 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€62.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€82.800 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£58,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£78,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Samsara, we&#39;re looking for a hands-on Staff Software Engineer to help turn growing Telematics products into major businesses. Our new product bets include routing and workforce management for physical operations.&lt;br&gt;The portfolio has paying customers and early traction. You&#39;ll help shape what comes next, working directly with customers to understand their operations, test ideas and build solutions they choose to use. You&#39;ll stay close to the work through production, customer adoption and scale.&lt;br&gt;This is a technical leadership role with substantial hands-on engineering. You&#39;ll define important problems and make product and technical decisions alongside Product, Design and Engineering partners. You&#39;ll bring the judgement to move forward when requirements are incomplete, and the influence to align other teams around a clear direction.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customers and customer-facing teams to understand unmet needs, test assumptions and identify opportunities worth pursuing. Agree on success measures with Product and Design before investing in a solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead ambiguous initiatives end to end, from discovery and prototypes through production rollout, adoption and iteration. Use customer feedback and product data to decide what to improve, expand or stop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and ship code on the critical path. Work across services, APIs and customer-facing experiences as the problem requires, combining technical depth with the ability to learn unfamiliar parts of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for your area and align the teams needed to deliver it. Make pragmatic architecture choices that support rapid learning today and reliable growth over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the production quality of what you build. Design for correctness, reliability and performance, plan safe rollouts, and use operational evidence to address the constraints that emerge as usage grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase the effectiveness of the engineers around you through design and code reviews, mentoring senior engineers, and removing recurring obstacles to delivery. Share context and decisions so others can move independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hire, develop and lead an inclusive, engaged, and high performing team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;What you will bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping customer-facing products and growing them beyond their initial launch. You can explain your contribution to measurable outcomes such as adoption, revenue growth, retention, customer efficiency or cost to serve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgement. You have worked directly with customers, clarified poorly defined problems and made decisions using evidence, including changing direction when an initial idea did not work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on software engineering ability, with recent experience designing, implementing and operating production systems. You can move from a prototype to maintainable software and explain the trade-offs along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling products and the systems behind them. You know how to identify the next constraint, balance speed with reliability, and make technical investments that support customer and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical leadership across team boundaries. You have built alignment without formal authority, made other engineers more effective, and communicated difficult choices clearly to technical and business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that could be useful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Experience building B2B software through an early growth stage, or working on routing, workforce management or other software for physical operations. We value evidence of learning a complex customer domain and delivering results; previous industry experience is helpful, rather than essential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Customers adopt the capabilities you help build and can see the benefit in their day-to-day operations. The products remain dependable as usage grows. Your technical decisions support measurable business progress, and the teams around you can deliver more effectively because of your work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Select Major Accounts&lt;/strong&gt; team is Samsara’s primary engine for enterprise growth, responsible for landing high-value, net-new logos across the UK &amp;amp; Ireland’s largest physical operations. In this role, you will lead multi-million-dollar, full-cycle sales processes from a cold start—executing a disciplined qualification playbook, building true C-suite champions, and closing strategic &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;385&quot;&gt;$1M+ ARR deals&lt;/strong&gt;. This position is built for an elite, strategic Account Executive who thrives in complex, multi-stakeholder environments—equally comfortable navigating IT and lines of business to digitize industries traditionally reliant on legacy systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Now? &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara combines the agility of a high-growth startup, the market authority of a public company, and the momentum of a hyper-scale tech leader. Named a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;176&quot;&gt;Best Place to Work for 3 consecutive years&lt;/strong&gt;, we offer enterprise sellers a combination of unique differentiators:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven Leadership &amp;amp; Hyper-Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Founded by serial entrepreneurs with a history of building multi-billion-dollar companies, Samsara has scaled past &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;149&quot;&gt;$2.1B+ ARR&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;165&quot;&gt;30%+ YoY &lt;/strong&gt;global growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Market-Dominating Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Backed by $2.8B+ in R&amp;amp;D investment, our Connected Operations Cloud makes us the Category Leader delivering class-leading AI, IoT, and telematics capabilities with a genuine AI moat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Massive Untapped Market:&lt;/strong&gt; Physical operations represent a $160B+ Global TAM, with EMEA remaining &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;95&quot;&gt;99% greenfield opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;This brings&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt; strong upside &lt;/strong&gt;earning potential on a winning trajectory, rapid professional growth alongside elite sales talent, and a massive, unpenetrated territory waiting to be captured.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Whilst we do support remote working, flexibility is required to travel to visit customers onsite across the region as required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world: &lt;/strong&gt;Your efforts will result in real-world impact—helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, and most importantly, ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mantra is #alwaysbeprospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; The world of operations is vast. Your customers are often out in the field and the best way to catch them is live on the phone. Samsara’s top reps do constant research to find companies and contacts to expand their pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have innate curiosity in how businesses work:&lt;/strong&gt; One day you’ll meet with someone in waste management and the next you may be learning about the inner workings of a food distribution center. Our top sales team members seek to learn the ins and outs of the businesses they support in order to make a larger impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a life-long learner: &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara sales are complex. You will need to learn about businesses where you previously had little knowledge. The payoff is big but you have to be willing to put in the work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build genuine relationships with your customers: &lt;/strong&gt;The industries we serve have relied on pen-and-paper solutions for years and haven’t been met with the type of technology we offer. Our customers value earned trust and human relationships built over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best: &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara’s high-performance Sales culture means you’ll be surrounded by the best and challenged to go farther than you have before.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Executive-Level relationships within strategic, named accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer engagements end-to-end, from prospecting and qualification to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate excellent solution-based sales process in complex sales campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobilize a large matrix virtual team of business stakeholders to include Operations, Finance, IT, dedicated Solution Engineer and Account Development Representative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Min. 7+ years&lt;/strong&gt; full-cycle Enterprise-level Account Executive closing expertise, winning complex SAAS deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven track record&lt;/strong&gt; of consistent quota over-achievement in complex accounts and $1M+ ARR deal execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;New Logo &amp;amp; Self-generated pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to build and win deals through a repeatable outbound prospecting motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Structured Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of Playbook methodology-led selling (e.g. MEDDPICC / Command of the Message / Force Management) to quantify genuine business pain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Champion &amp;amp; Economic Buyer navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to test and build true champions, access executive buying centres, and engineer compelling events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Team player used to winning as a team, collaborative and within a coachable growth mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awards for elite achievement (particularly President’s Club, Winner’s circle, Top 10%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about transformational technology in the world operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited about solving new problems in innovative ways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Know Your SEO? Let&#39;s Put Your Skills in the Spotlight!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;With millions of diners, 70,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Love data? Passionate about organic growth? Enjoy seeing your SEO strategies deliver real results? 📈&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Marketing Manager, SEO to help shape and grow OpenTable&#39;s organic search presence across 10+ international domains. If you enjoy identifying opportunities, developing strategies and turning insights into measurable impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own our organic growth strategy. Develop and deliver scalable SEO initiatives across our global domains, driving visibility, traffic and revenue growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Turn data into action. Analyse performance, monitor competitors and identify opportunities to improve rankings, engagement and conversion through continuous testing and optimisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Make every page count. Optimise website content, landing page templates, internal linking and link-building strategies to strengthen our organic presence across international markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate to make things happen. Partner with Product, Engineering, Content and local Market teams to resolve technical SEO challenges and deliver impactful projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Measure what matters. Own project planning, tracking and reporting, using insights to demonstrate results, refine strategies and identify new growth opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌟 What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong SEO experience. Proven experience in marketing, with hands-on SEO expertise within consumer technology, ideally in an in-house environment, and a proven track record of delivering measurable growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Technical SEO knowledge. A solid understanding of on-page and off-page SEO, link-building, HTML, CSS and search engine algorithms, including experience working across international websites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;An analytical mindset. Confident working with data, using tools like Google Sheets to identify opportunities, measure performance and turn insights into actionable strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A proactive, independent approach. Comfortable owning projects from strategy through to delivery, managing competing priorities and adapting in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Great communication and collaboration skills. Able to work effectively with cross-functional teams, influence stakeholders and communicate clearly in English. A degree in Marketing, Analytics or a related field, or equivalent practical experience, is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ Bonus Points If You Have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fluency in another European language, particularly German.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience beyond SEO in areas such as product management, digital marketing, data analytics or software engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with landing page prototyping tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A background in building or rebuilding SEO systems from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A genuine interest in how search behaviour, technology and online booking experiences are evolving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5 weeks paid vacation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Private health &amp;amp; dental insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to 20 days per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Focus on mental health and well-being:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Company-paid therapy sessions through SpringHealth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Company-paid subscription to Headspace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Annual company-wide week off a year - the whole team fully recharges (and returns without a pile-up of work!)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Time off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Paid volunteer time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Focus on your career growth:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Leadership development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Access to thousands of on-demand e-learnings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Travel Discounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Income protection and life assurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Employee Assistance Program - including 24/7 GP &amp;amp; free legal advice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Pension plan contributions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Discounted gym membership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bike2Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Season ticket loan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Social events &amp;amp; Thursday happy hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Free lunch 2 days per week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you need any reasonable adjustments during the application/interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 70,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EU engineering team in London is looking to hire an Android Engineer to join our team on a 12 month fixed term contract basis. In this role, you will work to strengthen the infrastructure behind our app, used by millions of diners worldwide. You will play a crucial role in improving the foundations of a large Kotlin codebase while shaping the technical roadmap for new data integrations and architecture. By collaborating across teams, you will help build and maintain the Android capabilities that support our marketing technology initiatives, including attribution and deep linking. Ultimately, your work will empower restaurants to thrive by creating reliable, high-performance experiences that encourage diners to return time and again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note: This is a 12 month fixed term contract.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the technical roadmap of new data integrations, application architecture, and scalability efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the core Android app’s architecture to ensure the codebase remains maintainable, scalable, and modern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and optimize marketing technology integrations, including attribution SDKs, measurement tools, and deep linking capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate the app’s overall reliability, performance, and testability while simplifying complex areas of the codebase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and diagnostics to identify potential issues, validate technical improvements, and optimize both end-user and developer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share technical knowledge and help shape best engineering practices across multiple squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience building and maintaining scalable, modern, and high-performing Android applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of improving the architecture of an established Android app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in writing maintainable Kotlin code with a deep value for testing, reliability, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with mobile analytics or attribution integrations, such as Firebase or attribution SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with engineering, marketing, and data stakeholders, explaining technical decisions clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across Android applications and the backend services that support them, including server-side Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for enhancing developer experience, infrastructure, and internal tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with creating and contributing to shared Android infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated appetite for continually refining the end-user experience through data-driven insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any reasonable adjustments during the application/interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help London&#39;s best restaurants do even better. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;🍽️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;With millions of diners, 70,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Account Executive to help grow OpenTable&#39;s restaurant network across the East and South East of London.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A little about the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for identifying and winning new restaurant partners, building strong relationships and helping businesses understand how OpenTable&#39;s technology can support their growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a consultative, new business sales role where you&#39;ll have the opportunity to manage your own territory, develop your pipeline and work closely with restaurants to understand their challenges and offer solutions that make a genuine difference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🏡&amp;nbsp;The role is remote, with up to 60% domestic travel, giving you plenty of opportunities to get out into the market, meet restaurant owners and build relationships face to face.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own and develop your territory, covering East and South East London, identifying new business opportunities and building a strong pipeline of prospective restaurant partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proactively reach out to restaurants through outbound prospecting, networking and relationship building to consistently achieve and exceed sales targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Take the time to understand each restaurant&#39;s business, challenges and goals, positioning OpenTable as a valuable long-term partner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver engaging, tailored demonstrations of OpenTable&#39;s products, showing restaurants how our technology can help improve their operations and drive revenue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop effective sales strategies, confidently handle objections and negotiate agreements to bring new partners on board.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage your pipeline, sales activity and forecasting through Salesforce, ensuring accurate and up-to-date records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Stay connected to the hospitality industry, building your market knowledge and sharing feedback and insights with our wider teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;list&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;spread&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1008,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:2011},&amp;quot;regular_list_item&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;start&amp;quot;:1008,&amp;quot;end&amp;quot;:1168}]&quot;&gt;🔎 &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our ideal candidate...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience in B2B enterprise sales experience, ideally within a new business or business development environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A strong track record of achieving sales targets, generating your own leads and managing opportunities through the full sales cycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Confidence in outbound prospecting, building relationships and engaging with senior decision-makers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using CRM systems such as Salesforce, alongside Google Workspace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Someone who is comfortable working independently, managing their own time and travelling regularly within their territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;✨&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you also have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working within hospitality, restaurant management, food and beverage or hospitality technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A consultative approach to sales, with strong discovery, negotiation and relationship-building skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The ability to use data and insights to build compelling business cases and demonstrate value to customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A proactive, commercially minded approach, with the confidence to challenge customers&#39; thinking and offer new perspectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A collaborative attitude, a willingness to learn and a genuine interest in the hospitality industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Private health &amp;amp; dental insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to 20 days per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Focus on mental health and well-being:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Company-paid therapy sessions through SpringHealth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Company-paid subscription to Headspace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Annual company-wide week off a year - the whole team fully recharges (and returns without a pile-up of work!)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Time off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Paid volunteer time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Focus on your career growth:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Leadership development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Access to thousands of on-demand e-learnings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Travel Discounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Income protection and life assurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Employee Assistance Program - including 24/7 GP &amp;amp; free legal advice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Pension plan contributions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Discounted gym membership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bike2Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Season ticket loan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Social events &amp;amp; Thursday happy hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Free lunch 2 days per week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The best connections happen face-to-face, whether you’re sitting down to dinner or having coffee with a coworker. That’s why OpenTable has adopted a hybrid workplace model. This role aligns with that approach, with an expectation of coming into the office two days a week—giving employees the best of both worlds: in-person collaboration and flexibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you need any reasonable adjustments during the application/interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director of Dedicated Infrastructure Engineering &amp;amp; Platforms, you will lead the engineering organization responsible for GitLab Dedicated, GitLab&#39;s premium single-tenant SaaS offering for enterprise customers in regulated industries, and public sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead a high-performing organization of managers and engineers who own the entire lifecycle of dedicated and cellular platforms, from orchestration, integrations, resilience, and incident response to switchboard APIs, public sector compliance, and enterprise customer migrations. Your mission is to scale GitLab Dedicated from its current trajectory toward an aggressive growth target, ensuring enterprise customers experience full platform capabilities with dedicated infrastructure, compliance certifications, and enterprise-grade SLAs in an isolated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a high-impact executive leader, you will define the strategy for single-tenant and public sector SaaS platforms, drive critical infrastructure investments, ensure FedRAMP/compliance operational readiness, and build the switchboard and migration capabilities that allow enterprise customers to seamlessly transition to and scale on Dedicated. You will succeed by cultivating a culture of operational excellence, closing key business and roadmap gaps, and leading distributed engineering teams to deliver high-availability, highly secure platform experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap for GitLab Dedicated, and ensure the platform scales with customer growth and converges with GitLab&#39;s cellular architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and executive leadership to deliver on growth targets, with a focus on platform reliability, faster customer onboarding, infrastructure cost efficiency, and self-service administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the engineering teams that build and run the platform: tenant orchestration and integrations, resilience and incident response, the Switchboard control plane, public sector platforms and compliance, and enterprise migrations and import tooling. Uphold enterprise-grade SLAs across every tenant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver GitLab Dedicated for Government: AWS GovCloud infrastructure, FedRAMP operations and audit readiness, air-gapped isolation, and public sector feature delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make enterprise migrations to Dedicated predictable, repeatable, and low-disruption through self-service tooling and guided workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, coach, and scale engineering managers across distributed teams, and bring practical AI-enabled workflows into how the organization works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Security, and Customer Support to keep customer commitments, architecture, and investments aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led engineering organizations that run enterprise single or multi tenant SaaS infrastructure and cloud platforms at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have measurably improved production reliability, reduced toil, or lowered infrastructure cost on a platform you owned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep expertise in cloud-native and cellular architectures, Infrastructure as Code, and modular services that deploy and scale independently across cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have delivered and operated enterprise offerings under strict compliance regimes such as FedRAMP and AWS GovCloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led organizational changes, including adopting AI enabled workflows that raise engineering system efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You translate financial targets into engineering investments, headcount plans, and execution roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead with ownership, speed with quality, and a focus on customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Dedicated Infrastructure &amp;amp; Platforms organization builds and runs GitLab Dedicated, our single-tenant enterprise SaaS offering, for GitLab&#39;s most strategic enterprise and public sector accounts. It is organized into five focus areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform Orchestration &amp;amp; Integrations: orchestration, deployment, and environment automation for Dedicated tenants and cellular environments, plus integrations with external products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Features, Resilience &amp;amp; Response: compliance and operations driven features, disaster recovery, automated failover, rate limiting, and incident response automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Switchboard &amp;amp; Control Plane: the APIs, tenant change automation, and operator and customer interfaces that make Dedicated self-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public Sector Platforms &amp;amp; Compliance: AWS GovCloud infrastructure, FedRAMP compliance operations, air-gapped isolation, and Geo replication for GitLab Dedicated for Government.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Migrations &amp;amp; Import Tooling: customer migration programs and playbooks, Geo-based migration tooling, Direct Transfer, and self-service guided import workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$279,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$349,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;an-overview-of-this-role&quot; data-lfile-container=&quot;21ea07e5-ded4-47e8-ad92-4ca7b7d6be35&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Corporate Development Director, you&#39;ll help influence how GitLab invests to win: what we build, what we buy, where we partner, and what we should not pursue. This role sits within the Corporate Development &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships team, reporting to the VP, Corporate Development &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role straddles strategy and M&amp;amp;A engagements. You&#39;ll lead research that frames GitLab&#39;s options: mapping the markets in and around our AI-powered DevSecOps platform, testing where we have a right to win, and turning that into clear recommendations for the executive team. When the answer is to acquire, you&#39;ll drive the deal process end to end, from outreach through close and integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success here is not measured by deal count. It looks like sharper strategic choices: a well-reasoned point of view on our priority markets, investment theses that product and executive leaders rely on, acquisitions that speed up the roadmap when buying is the right answer, and an educated no when it isn&#39;t. You&#39;ll own the wider market perspective rather than individual product categories, and work with the team&#39;s Analyst on the research behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;strategy-and-research&quot;&gt;Strategy and research&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the wider market view.&lt;/strong&gt; Research the broader market GitLab competes in, beyond specific product categories: competitive dynamics, AI-native entrants, technology shifts and where value is moving. Collaborate with the team&#39;s Analyst on the research and turn the findings into a clear point of view on where GitLab should play.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build an investment thesis for each focus area.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Product and Engineering leaders to define the problems worth solving, the capabilities GitLab needs, and what it would cost in time and money to get there on our own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the competitive and landscape view.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain market maps and a current read on GitLab&#39;s competitors: their strategy, product direction, positioning, pricing, and M&amp;amp;A and funding activity. Produce competitor analyses that show where we lead, where we&#39;re exposed and how rivals are likely to move. Flag shifts by competitors, hyperscalers and AI labs that change our options, and bring the implications to Product and the executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define where GitLab should not play.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify adjacencies that dilute focus and markets where the economics or competition work against us. Make the case for a no with the same rigor as a yes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;build-buy-or-partner&quot;&gt;Build, buy or partner&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the build, buy, partner analysis.&lt;/strong&gt; For each strategic gap, compare the options side by side on speed, cost, risk, control and strategic fit, and bring a clear recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver strategic clarity to&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;executives and the Board.&lt;/strong&gt; Produce short strategy memos/decks and business cases that set out the decision, the trade-offs and what we give up with each path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feed company strategy and planning.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring an outside-in view of the market and the inorganic options available into annual and long-range planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work hand in hand with Strategic Partnerships.&lt;/strong&gt; When partnering is the right answer, frame the opportunity and hand it to the partnership owner with a clear thesis. When it isn&#39;t, explain why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;deal-execution-and-integration&quot;&gt;Deal execution and integration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own end-to-end deal process management.&lt;/strong&gt; Validate target fit against GitLab&#39;s our target profile, product roadmap and other criteria, and build the acquisition rationale and business case. Drive our M&amp;amp;A process from intro call through the various steps through to closing and integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluate the deal.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop valuation, commercial integrity assessment, impact on GitLab&#39;s business and provide negotiations assistance to the VP and the executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-functional diligence.&lt;/strong&gt; Run pre-LOI validation and diligence across Product, Engineering, Security, Finance, Legal and People, and communicate findings clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive deal documents with Legal.&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare NDAs, LOIs and purchase agreements with GitLab Legal and outside counsel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own integration outcomes.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead post-acquisition integration as the DRI, measured against the roadmap and business goals in the business case. Bring lessons learned back into the strategy work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the external network.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain relationships with founders, executives, investors, bankers and advisors that bring us early insight and pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-bring&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and deal experience.&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years across corporate development, corporate strategy, strategy consulting or technology investing, including 5+ years leading acquisitions end to end in enterprise software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured strategic thinking.&lt;/strong&gt; You form a point of view from incomplete information, test it against data, and change your mind when the evidence says so. You&#39;re as comfortable recommending that we stay out of a market as that we enter it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market research depth.&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in market sizing, competitive analysis and landscape mapping, and in turning research into a recommendation, not a report.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal craft.&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in valuation, financial modeling, deal structuring, negotiation and integration planning, with experience across varied consideration structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; A working understanding of software development, DevSecOps and the AI landscape, enough to hold substantive conversations with product and engineering leaders about roadmaps and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear executive communication.&lt;/strong&gt; You write short, decision-ready updates and present trade-offs plainly to executives and the Board, in an async-first environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence without authority.&lt;/strong&gt; You build trust across Product, Engineering, Finance and Legal and move decisions forward across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership with collaboration.&lt;/strong&gt; You own the strategic view and the recommendation, and partner closely with the team&#39;s Analyst on research and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt; familiarity with the DevSecOps, security, AI and open source ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You value the &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/all-remote/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;all remote&lt;/a&gt; lifestyle and share our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/values/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about-the-team&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Corporate Development &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships team helps GitLab decide how to grow beyond what we build on our own. We own inorganic strategy: acquisitions, strategic partnerships with hyperscalers and AI labs, and the research that tells us which to pursue and which to pass on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work across Product, Engineering, Finance, Legal and the executive group. We set direction and do the detailed work ourselves, with a high degree of ownership and transparency in a fully remote, asynchronous environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Sales Engineer to join our team. This is a hybrid based in the UK role, reporting to the Senior Sales Engineering Manager in the Solutions Consulting department. You will be a key technical driver in our mission, presenting the Zscaler cloud security platform to prospective customers and translating their goals into enticing, relevant recommendations. You’ll act as a trusted advisor, guiding clients through their transformational journey while delivering technical victories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present the Zscaler cloud security platform to prospective customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the vision and translate goals into enticing and relevant recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become the trusted advisor to our clients while aiding their transformational journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather customer technical requirements and promote the value proposition in POV, presentations, and demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience as a Sales Engineer or Systems Integrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of enterprise network or cloud security technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Value Selling Methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience partnering with sales to deliver high-impact presentations, demos, and proof of concept engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a proven ability to leverage AI technologies and workflows to drive measurable operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience architecting or demonstrating AI-enhanced cybersecurity platforms, automated threat response tools, or machine learning-driven network analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Platform certifications or other relevant credentials such as CISSP or CCNP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject matter expertise in SASE, Proxy technology, Cybersecurity, IPS, DLP, CASB, or CNAPP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-LS2&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive at Anthropic, you&#39;ll join the foundational team at the forefront of introducing our cutting-edge AI productivity API and SaaS solutions to professional services firms across the EMEA markets. You&#39;ll drive the adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic deals with consultancies, agency and marketing services groups, law firms, and accounting and advisory firms. You&#39;ll leverage your consultative sales expertise in the professional services sector to propel revenue growth while becoming a trusted partner to professional services stakeholders, helping them embed and deploy AI while uncovering its full range of capabilities in client delivery, research and analysis, and knowledge management. In collaboration with GTM, Product, and Marketing teams, you&#39;ll continuously refine our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to resonate with professional services decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a passion for developing new market segments, pinpointing high-potential opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. By driving deployment of Anthropic&#39;s emerging products, you will help enterprises obtain new capabilities while also advancing the ethical development of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic within the professional services sector. Navigate complex professional services firms to reach key decision-makers, educate them about our services, and help them succeed with Anthropic. You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle, from first outbound to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute innovative sales strategies tailored to professional services procurement cycles, vendor risk assessment, and budgeting processes to meet and exceed revenue quotas. Analyse professional services market landscapes, trends, and dynamics to translate high-level plans into targeted sales activities and campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead market expansion by identifying new use cases within client delivery teams, creative and strategy functions, research and knowledge management, and business development. Collaborate cross-functionally to differentiate our offerings for professional services applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex professional services stakeholder ecosystems including executives, partners and practice leaders, IT departments, risk and compliance functions, and procurement offices to build consensus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform product roadmaps and features by gathering feedback from users and conveying professional services market needs. Provide insights that strengthen our value proposition for professional services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine the professional services sales methodology by incorporating learnings into playbooks, templates, and best practices. Identify process improvements that optimise sales productivity and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of B2B Enterprise sales experience in SaaS, API solutions, or emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing complex sales cycles within professional services firms and securing strategic deals by understanding both technical requirements and professional services use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate professional services organisational structures and procurement processes, building consensus among diverse stakeholders including executives, partners and practice leaders, and IT departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience negotiating complex agreements within professional services procurement frameworks, vendor risk and third-party assurance policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets by effectively managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to present confidently to various professional services audiences, from practice leads and delivery teams to senior partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of professional services buying cycles, decision-making processes, and key pain points, including the client confidentiality and regulatory obligations firms operate within&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic, analytical approach to assessing the professional services market combined with creative, tactical execution to capture opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems and their applications. You feel strongly about ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely and ethically for professional services use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£280,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£330,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

