Are you a highly-motivated, technically-minded, critical thinker looking for your next challenge? Join a leading consulting player in the booming space industry!&nbsp;


  Our consulting service lines span strategy, market development and innovation advisory. &nbsp;


We are seeking a motivated and analytically Senior consultant to support advisory work across government and institutional clients. 
The role focuses on national space strategy development, institutional assessments, and policy advisory, contributing to impactful projects across the global space ecosystem.&nbsp;


This is a client-facing role in our Paris office, offering exposure to high-profile engagements in areas such as satellite communications (satcom), Earth observation (EO), launch, exploration, and space situational awareness (SSA).&nbsp;


 &nbsp;


If this sounds like you, then read on!&nbsp;

Key responsabilities



Contribute to space policy and strategy consulting missions, including government advisory, national space strategy development, and institutional assessments&nbsp;






