&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pasted=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SiTime&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SiTime Corporation is the precision timing company. Our semiconductor MEMS programmable solutions offer a rich feature set that enables customers to differentiate their products with higher performance, smaller size, lower power and better reliability. With more than 3 billion devices shipped, SiTime is changing the timing industry. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=KZboO_E5KYNf2nXu9snYUrujcxPVV14r8VUqaw-krQjviK4SVzg-T3gX0Yv8pdrIU2yKG5VITW08WA-AWCTQKQ==&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.sitime.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team that is revolutionizing the timing industry with the best silicon Microelectromechanical Systems (MEMS) timing products in the world. As a Principal MEMS Development Engineer, you will use your technical and creative problem-solving skills to push forward MEMS technology and engineer resonators for SiTime’s next-generation timing products. It is not necessary to meet all job requirements to be a qualified candidate for the position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead definition and execution of challenging technical projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise management of challenges, impact, recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new or improved resonators, MEMS technologies and/or products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design MEMS devices and characterize their electrical, mechanical, and thermal performance on wafer level and/or device level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with process team to drive continuous improvement in MEMS yields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and enhance automated infrastructure for MEMS design, measurements, and data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and analyze experiments to understand device physics, materials, and fabrication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with local and overseas vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in cross-functional teams, including circuits, systems, and packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working/supporting other projects as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Requirements: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ph.D. in ME, EE, Physics, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled scientist with ability to design, conduct, and analyze experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem identification and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of mechanics, electrodynamics, thermodynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge in fundamentals of MEMS devices physics and fabrication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with finite element simulation tools (COMSOL, ANSYS) and data processing tools (Matlab, Python).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, organizational, written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for delivering exceptional results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Characteristics &amp;amp; Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 -10 years of industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate to advanced knowledge of programing languages, circuits, metrology equipment and methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Statistical analysis and tools such as R or JMP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge in MEMS microfabrication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SiTime, we believe great work deserves great rewards. We offer a comprehensive and highly competitive compensation package designed to attract top talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;In addition to base salary, this role is eligible for a quarterly bonus tied to the achievement of innovation goals—reflecting our commitment to recognizing meaningful impact. We also offer equity grants, providing a meaningful opportunity to share in the company’s future growth and success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SiTime is an &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.sitime.com/images/EEO-is-the-law.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;We treat each person fairly and we do not tolerate discrimination or harassment against anyone on the basis of any protected characteristics, including race, color, religion, national or ethnic origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, disability, pregnancy, political affiliation, protected veteran status, protected genetic information, or marital status or other characteristics protected by law.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn More about SiTime:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Review the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sitime.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Get to Know SiTime&lt;/a&gt; section of our career page to explore our culture, values, and what makes us unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.innovatorsontap.com/podcast/the-philosophy-of-innovation-w-rajesh-vashist&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Innovation on Top – Philosophies of Innovation with Rajesh Vashist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fabricatedknowledge.com/p/an-interview-with-rajesh-vashist-3e0#details&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fabrication Knowledge – An Interview with Rajesh Vashist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/user/sitimecorp/videos&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;SiTime Corporation – YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE, ON DEMAND&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal blend of stability and flexibility. A genuinely human employer that cares for people and the planet. True autonomy to shape what comes next, for us and you. This is the perfect platform to take your career where you want.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Back in 2005, we pioneered Europe’s first TV streaming service. Today, we&#39;re a leading TV streaming provider with millions of monthly users, and since 2021 we&#39;ve been ClimatePartner-certified. Over 200 colleagues of 47 nationalities. We’re the grown-up start-up, helping to shape a better future since day one.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;That hasn’t changed, even if the world has. We’re friendly, international, inclusive – and our people say we’re reliable and transparent, too. It’s why they trust us and believe in what we do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Programmatic Sales GSA, you will be responsible for the automated and data-driven sale of our digital advertising inventory (primarily video and CTV) and report directly to the Director Sales All Markets. You will manage programmatic bookings, oversee the planning, implementation and optimisation of our initiatives to boost revenue in programmatic sales, and will therefore also be directly responsible for the optimisation and smooth, technical implementation of campaigns. This makes you the primary point of contact for agency trading desks in the GSA region regarding preferred deals and PMP strategies. You’ll also help with SSP and header bidding integrations and act as the link between Sales, Tech and AdOps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ADS TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ads Team is a small but highly efficient team that combines technology and marketing to win customers over in the long term. With a presence in two countries (based in Berlin, Hamburg and Zurich) and operations in six countries, the Ads Team is a key driver of growth within Zattoo and has established itself as the market leader in CTV in Switzerland within a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquisition of new customers, advice, support and guide media agencies, trading desks and direct clients through our programmatic possibilities in a way they can understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drawing up and negotiating bespoke programme packages, private deals or preferred deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximise inventory revenue, skilfully manage floor prices (minimum prices) and analyse delivery rates and CPMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional sales teams in GSA to consult clients and pitch programmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-lead the technical and commercial setup of Header Bidding and additional SSP integrations for CTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-line technical ownership of programmatic delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical errors during delivery, analyse tracking issues and check campaign set-ups: troubleshoot deal delivery, floor pricing, and DSP configuration issues (e.g., SSAI, VAST responses, pod management, DSP/SSP bid stream mismatches).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain complex technical matters in simple terms to non-technical customers or internal departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in Programmatic Advertising, SSP Management, or Programmatic Account Management (strong experience in CTV/Video)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record in the sales of digital advertising products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Google Ad Manager, DSP/SSP workflows, OpenRTB specs, and deal types (Preferred Deals, PMP, PG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or strong technical familiarity with Header Bidding frameworks (e.g., Prebid) and SSP integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network or understanding of the DACH Agency Trading Desk landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent, strong communicator, able to work under pressure, with strong negotiation skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamplayer and creative thinker with a questioning mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHY JOIN US?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Zattoo, you’re always on firm ground with real freedom to explore. You’ll have the support and opportunity you need to go far, while you’re helping us create a sustainable and entertainment-filled future for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward&lt;/strong&gt;: strong market competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recharge&lt;/strong&gt;: 30 days vacation plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulate&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;trust based flexible working hours and the option for remote work worldwide for up to 8 weeks per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sharing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Free access to the best streaming experience on the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re developing: &lt;/strong&gt;Your own development budget, German classes and Zattoo all-company&amp;nbsp;hack days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re inclusive: ‘&lt;/strong&gt;Zattooies’ are a fun, engaged, and diverse team made up of 47 nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re healthy:&lt;/strong&gt; Health checks, mental wellbeing support, team sports and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re responsible:&lt;/strong&gt; We are carbon neutral, an active employee Green team, discounted BVG tickets and free bike rentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re sociable: &lt;/strong&gt;A&amp;nbsp;calendar of events with fireside chats, lunches, in-house bar, BBQ’s, monthly socials, summer party and an annual off-site event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zattoo enables our users to view indiscriminately and we reflect that in our team too. Regardless of race, gender, sexual orientation, religion, national origin, age, disability or any other characteristic protected by law we encourage everyone to apply and will give everyone equal consideration. We are an equal opportunities employer — join us and help build a diverse team dedicated to revolutionising the way you watch TV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to ensuring fair, open, and equitable hiring practices and are happy to answer any questions you may have about us or the role throughout the whole process. In line with the EU Pay Transparency Directive, we share the applicable compensation range with you before your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-justify&quot;&gt;You can learn more about us at: &lt;a href=&quot;https://zattoo.com/company/jobs/&quot;&gt;https://zattoo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a global team of innovators and pioneers dedicated to shaping the future of observability. At New Relic, we build an intelligent platform that empowers companies to thrive in an AI-first world by giving them unparalleled insight into their complex systems. As we continue to expand our global footprint, we&#39;re looking for passionate people to join our mission. If you&#39;re ready to help the world&#39;s best companies optimize their digital applications, we invite you to explore a career with us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_c57d2138b14e9ae2&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Your Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Are you ready to take ownership of high-value technical evaluations for new enterprise prospects across some of the world&#39;s most recognizable brands? Join New Relic as a Senior Solutions Consultant, where you will leverage your unique blend of technical expertise, commercial acumen, and customer-centricity to acquire new logos and drive market expansion across our DACH and Eastern Europe (EE) markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;In this role, you won&#39;t just be ticking boxes; you will be the absolute owner of the technical &#39;win&#39; for net-new clients. Partnering closely with our Enterprise Account Executives, you will guide technical sales strategies, displace legacy competitors, and establish deep, trusted relationships with prospective enterprise accounts. You will have the autonomy to run with your insights, serving as a critical bridge between complex prospective customer environments and our internal Product and Engineering teams to directly influence the evolution of our market-leading Intelligent Observability platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Secure the Technical Win:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Sales teams to drive new logo acquisition, winning net-new business and establishing our initial Annual Consumption Revenue (ACR) footprint in strategic prospective accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Consult &amp;amp; Architect:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical discovery sessions, deliver tailored Proof of Value (PoV/PoC) presentations, conduct structured architectural workshops, and craft compelling responses to RFX/RFIs to outmaneuver competitors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Establish Trusted Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Deeply understand prospective customers&#39; business objectives and technical landscapes to build long-term relationships, helping them eliminate digital experience disruptions from Day 1 and realize maximum platform value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evangelize Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively champion new product capabilities to greenfield prospects while channeling structured field feedback from new buyer interactions directly to New Relic Product Managers and Engineering leads to fuel future platform evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Expand the team’s operational reach by collaborating seamlessly with Solution Architects, Partner teams, and Customer Success colleagues to navigate complex enterprise acquisition cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;This Role Requires:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enterprise Pre-Sales Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of leading and managing large, complex pre-sales engagements focused on &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;124&quot;&gt;new logo acquisition&lt;/strong&gt; for enterprise-level organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Modern Cloud Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on familiarity with native cloud technologies, including Kubernetes, containers, microservices, SRE practices, DevOps, and continuous integration/continuous deployment (CI/CD) pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Full-Stack Technological Breadth:&lt;/strong&gt; A foundational understanding that spans modern enterprise layers, from user experience and cloud applications to infrastructure, networks, data, and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data-Driven Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong grasp of how telemetry, insight, and data enable better decision-making within prospective global organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Superb Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with the ability to engage, influence, and build credibility with both prospective engineering teams and C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Language Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional proficiency (written and spoken) in both German and English to support the DACH and EE region effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Observability Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience working with performance monitoring tools across infrastructure, application (APM), network, or digital experience monitoring (DEM) in competitive deal cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mobile Architecture Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with mobile device platforms and architectures across iOS and Android ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Academic Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; A Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or an equivalent technical field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based in or around Munich, Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;#LI-JJ2 #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fostering a diverse, welcoming and inclusive environment is important to us. We work hard to make everyone feel comfortable bringing their best, most authentic selves to work every day. We celebrate our talented Relics’ different backgrounds and abilities, and recognize the different paths they took to reach us – including nontraditional ones. Their experiences and perspectives inspire us to make our products and company the best they can be. We’re looking for people who feel connected to our mission and values, not just candidates who check off all the boxes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require a reasonable accommodation to complete any part of the application or recruiting process, please reach out to &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;We believe in empowering all Relics to achieve professional and business success through a flexible workforce model. This model allows us to work in a variety of workplaces that best support our success, including fully office-based, fully remote, or hybrid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In compliance with applicable law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work and to complete employment eligibility verification. Note: Our stewardship of the data of thousands of customers means that a criminal background check is required to join New Relic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We will consider qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records based on individual circumstances and in accordance with applicable law including, but not limited to, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/FCO%20poster2020.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. New Relic does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes, and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with New Relic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Relic develops and distributes encryption software and technology that complies with U.S. export controls and licensing requirements. Certain New Relic roles require candidates to pass an export compliance assessment as a condition of employment in any global location. If relevant, we will provide more information later in the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates are evaluated based on qualifications, regardless of race, religion, ethnicity, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, age, disability, neurodiversity, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review our Applicant Privacy Notice at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at Auterion, you will play a pivotal role in the successful development, integration and deployment of Auterion-powered drone systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will collaborate closely with the production, hardware engineering, and firmware/software teams, as well as operations, ensuring that every platform transitions smoothly from an airframe concept into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. You will serve as the primary technical interface for partners, work closely with them to understand their technical requirements, configure and adapt existing solutions, contribute to core software development, and ensure successful implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an engineer who enjoys combining hands-on technical work with customer collaboration and system-level problem solving, bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage software releases and perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 or adjacent autopilot ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide deep avionics and airframe expertise, including autopilot tuning, sensor and payload integration, power systems and airworthiness considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to troubleshoot integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to escalate complex challenges when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical authority in customer engagements, translating mission requirements into concrete system architectures and demonstrable solutions built on AuterionOS and Skynode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance, resolving technical issues often directly in the field during customer trials and demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical documentation and continuous improvement of engineering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed customer and market requirements back into product and engineering teams to influence the roadmap of the Auterion stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Software, Electrical, Mechanical, Aerospace or Robotics Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in C/C++ and Python: you can read, debug and patch existing code and write small tools and scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in Linux environments, including the command line, logs, Docker and basic networking (IP, TCP/UDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on hardware-software integration: system bring-up, wiring and connectors, and embedded interfaces (UART, CAN, I2C, SPI) at a practical level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured troubleshooting: you can isolate whether a problem is software, hardware, configuration or RF, often under time pressure in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator: you can explain technical issues clearly to customers and operators, and report findings back to engineering in a way they can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel and work on-site with customers, including at test ranges and in field environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship (required for security clearance and customer requirements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4 or ArduPilot, MAVLink, QGroundControl or mission planning tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UAV flight testing and validation in operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with datalinks and radio systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous customer-facing or field engineering role, especially with defense or government customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Der fehlende Wirkungsnachweis ist das größte Problem im stationären Handel für Werbungtreibende.&amp;nbsp;Obwohl Marken Millionen in Werbung am Point of Sale investieren, können sie nicht belegen, ob daraus&lt;br&gt;Käufe wurden.&amp;nbsp;Verve Retail Media (VRM) löst dieses Problem. Wir vermarkten und betreiben digitale Werbe-Screens in&amp;nbsp;mehreren tausend LEH-, Drogerie- und Convenience-Standorten und verbinden sie mit digitalen&lt;br&gt;Coupons, Retargeting im CTV und anderen Offsite-Kanälen. Marken buchen bei uns keine isolierten Werbeformate, sondern 360-Grad-Kampagnen, die zu Hause starten und bis zum Einkaufsregal reichen -eine Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VRM ist die eigenständige Retail Media Unit der börsennotierten Verve Group SE. Wir arbeiten wie ein&amp;nbsp;schnell skalierendes Startup mit AI-First-Strategie über alle Funktionen und mit Zugriff auf die&amp;nbsp;Infrastruktur eines internationalen AdTech-Unternehmens mit über einer Billionen ausgelieferter&amp;nbsp;Werbeimpressionen pro Jahr. Zur Verve Retail Media gehört seit kurzem der Couponing- und&amp;nbsp;Cashback-Spezialist acardo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle in einem Satz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Du trägst eine Hunter-Mentalität in dir und gewinnst neue Umsätze bei FMCG-Marken, indem du&amp;nbsp;integrierte Shopper Activation Kampagnen verkaufst: d.h. coupon-getriebene Conversion und messbarer&amp;nbsp;Sales Lift, idealerweise erweitert um Screen-Präsenz im Markt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du verkaufst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein kombiniertes Produkt aus digitaler Sichtbarkeit im Markt Screens an Eingang, Fläche, Kasse), Aktivierung am Point of Sale (über Coupons) und Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten (anstatt isolierter Werbeflächen oder losgelöster Coupons)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kampagnen, die drei Logiken beim Kunden verbinden: Markenreichweite, Abverkauf und Kategorie-Relevanz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;360Grad-Aktivierung, die über den Markt hinausgeht: (Re)Targeting im CTV und weiteren Offsite-Kanälen als Verlängerung der In-Store-Kampagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Konkrete Beweispunkte aus Pilotprojekten: z.B. 9% Uplift auf Store-Ebene, 20% in ausgewählten Kategorien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An wen du verkaufst&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkt an FMCG-Marken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Ansprechpartner kommen meist aus Brand und Media (-Planung und -Einkauf) und verwalten &lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;drei Budgettöpfe mit unterschiedlichen Zielen, Freigabelogiken und Erfolgsmetriken&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigene Pipeline aufbauen, entwickeln, priorisieren und mit belastbarem Forecast führen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neukunden und Stakeholder (horizontal und vertikal) gewinnen und Kunden zu wiederkehrenden Partnern entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Den kompletten Sales-Zyklus verantworten: Erstansprache, Qualifizierung, Bedarfsanalyse, Angebot, Verhandlung und Abschluss. Mit Abschluss erfolgt die Übergabe ans AdOps Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kundenziele in Media- und Aktivierungskonzepte übersetzen: Touchpoints, Reichweiten, Zielgruppen, Mechaniken Cashback, Gratis-Testen, Kategorie-Trigger), Messansatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales-Lift-Daten und Pilotergebnisse als Beweispunkte im Pitch einsetzen, um aus ersten Testbudgets hohe wiederkehrende Volumina zu machen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VRM gegenüber konkurrierenden Retail-Media-Formaten klar differenzieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback aus dem Markt in Produkt, Pitchmaterial und Go-to-Market zurückspielen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So ist die Rolle aufgesetzt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist ein Individual Contributor ohne Personalverantwortung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du berichtest direkt an die CSO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verkaufst eigenständig, aber nicht allein: Media Planning entwickelt das Kampagnen-Setup, Ad Operations steuert die Auslieferung, Data Science liefert den Wirkungsnachweis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dein Fokus ist kommerziell: Pipeline, Abschluss, Kundentiefe, Wiederbuchung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum diese Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du liebst es, Dinge von Grund auf mit aufzubauen. Denn bei uns steigst du nicht in eine fertige Vermarktungsmaschine mit festem Produktkatalog ein, sondern du baust eine neue Mediagattung im deutschen Markt mit auf. Die Deals, die du jetzt gewinnst, werden intern und extern zu Referenzen. Sie prägen, wie Marken und Agenturen In-Store Retail Media künftig bewerten und einkaufen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Echte Ownership: deine Pipeline, deine Kunden, dein Umsatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkter Zugang zu CSO und CEO bei strategischen Kunden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein Produkt, das mehr kann als Reichweite verkaufen: Sichtbarkeit, Aktivierung und messbare Wirkung bis zum Kauf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-gestützte Tools und Workflows, die deine Produktivität vervielfachen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du lieber Benchmarks setzt als bestehende Playbooks abarbeitest, ist das die richtige Rolle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Verve bietet allen Mitarbeitenden und Bewerber:innen gleiche Beschäftigungschancen und verbietet Diskriminierung und&amp;nbsp;Belästigung jeglicher Art, unabhängig von Herkunft, Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, Geschlechtsidentität,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Behinderung oder anderen gesetzlich geschützten Merkmalen.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Harbor is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Data Migration and Integration Consultant &lt;/strong&gt;to join our HR and payroll transformation practice. This is a technical consulting role at the heart of our delivery work, responsible for moving client data safely and accurately into modern HR platforms and for designing and building the integrations that keep those platforms connected to the wider technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across engagements involving SAP SuccessFactors, Workday and Oracle HCM, taking clients from messy, fragmented legacy data through to clean, validated go live loads, and from integration requirements through to tested, supportable interfaces. The role suits someone who enjoys the detail of data work but can also explain it clearly to HR and business stakeholders who do not speak in file formats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote position based in the UK, with travel to client sites as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you will do:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data migration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and deliver data migration workstreams into SAP SuccessFactors, Workday or Oracle HCM, from strategy and planning through to go live and hypercare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define migration approaches, including scoping of data objects, load sequencing, cutover plans and rollback positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profile and assess legacy data quality, identifying gaps, duplicates and inconsistencies, and agreeing cleansing ownership with the client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain mapping and transformation rules between legacy sources and target system structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, execute and reconcile data loads across multiple test cycles, mock conversions and production cutover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce validation and reconciliation reporting that gives clients confidence in the accuracy and completeness of migrated data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on data retention, archiving and the treatment of historical records&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration design and delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and document integration requirements across HR, payroll, benefits, finance and third party providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce integration designs and specifications covering data flows, transformation logic, error handling, scheduling and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, test and deploy integrations using platform native tooling and middleware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support end to end and payroll parallel testing, resolving defects across connected systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define monitoring, error resolution and support processes so that integrations are sustainable after go live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on integration architecture, including the trade offs between point to point connections, middleware and file based approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ETL and data engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use ETL tooling to extract, transform and load data at scale across migration and integration workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable, auditable transformation routines rather than one off manual manipulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate validation and reconciliation checks where practical to reduce cycle times and manual effort&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of practice accelerators, templates and reusable migration assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client and practice contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the trusted technical voice on engagements, translating data and integration matters into plain language for HR and programme stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support proposals, scoping and estimating for migration and integration workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach junior consultants and share technical knowledge across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven data migration experience into at least one of SAP SuccessFactors, Workday or Oracle HCM, across multiple full lifecycle projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration design and technical delivery experience, including producing specifications and building and testing interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience with ETL tooling and confidence manipulating large, imperfect datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of HR and payroll data structures, including the sensitivities around personal data and the importance of accuracy at cutover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running reconciliation and validation across test cycles and production loads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator, able to work with both technical teams and HR stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the UK and willingness to travel to client sites when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across more than one of the three target platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of platform specific tooling such as Workday EIB, Core Connectors and Studio, SAP Integration Suite and Infoporter, or Oracle HDL and OIC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payroll migrations and parallel run reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UK GDPR and the data protection considerations that apply to migration and integration work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to professional services or legal sector clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting experience, or client-side experience with a clear consulting mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you can expect:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Varied technical work across three major HR platforms, rather than being tied to a single technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative practice with direct access to senior leadership and genuine input into how we grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investment in platform certifications and wider professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary, bonus and benefits, with flexible and remote working supported&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;x_ContentPasted0&quot;&gt;About Us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;x_ContentPasted0&quot;&gt;Harbor is the preeminent provider of expert services across strategy, legal technology, operations, and intelligence. Our globally integrated team of 900+ strategists, technologists, and specialists navigate alongside our clients – leading law firms, corporations, and their law departments – to provide essential resources and invaluable insights. Anchored in a rich heritage of deep knowledge, steadfast relationships, and mutual respect, our unwavering dedication lies in shaping the future of the legal industry and fostering enduring partnerships within our community and ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;x_ContentPasted0&quot;&gt;Harbor is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, civil union status, national origin, ancestry, age, parental status, disabled status, veteran status, or any other legally protected classification, in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Analytics Consultant &lt;/strong&gt;to sit within our dynamic Analytics Services team&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;The Analytics Services team specializes in fraud prevention and securing trust in the e-commerce space. Reporting to the Manager, Global Analytics Services, this role will be pivotal in bridging analytical expertise with real-world applications to the business field in the EMEA region. Please apply if you have strong analytical skills and have demonstrated the ability to influence internal and external stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with some of the largest global retailers to support their unique challenges and provide tailored analytical solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct thorough data analysis to extract insights that will drive business goals, mostly using Snowflake DB and Kibana.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted advisor, guiding clients on best practices and strategies for all of our products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Stay abreast of industry trends, emerging threats, and advancements in fraud prevention technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work closely with internal stakeholders, including Sales, Customer Success, and Analytics to maximize value and success for Forter’s strategic accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate effectively across time zones as part of a globally distributed team, including leadership based in the US.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 5+ years of professional experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience in a client-facing analytics, consulting, or professional services function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;SQL is required, plus proficiency in at least one of Python or R.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in data analysis tools: SQL is a must, Python is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to convey complex analytical concepts to non-quant audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead and manage analytical projects from inception to completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;An ability to be proactive and strategic with the needs and challenges of our clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in fraud prevention, payments, or enterprise B2B SaaS is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Commerce is evolving faster than the systems built to support it. Agentic AI is redrawing how people buy. Customer expectations have a new ceiling. And bad actors are evolving alongside every advancement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Forter was built to meet this moment — and stay ahead of it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are a human-first, AI-built company. Our technology analyzes patterns across a network of over 2 billion shoppers, delivering identity intelligence across the entire commerce journey — from sign-up to checkout to returns — that protects revenue and unlocks great customer experiences simultaneously. With Forter, businesses know who to trust, whether it’s humans or the agents shopping for them. The result: zero friction for the customers who matter. No revenue left behind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The world&#39;s most trusted brands — Nordstrom, Instacart, Priceline, Adobe, ASOS, and eBay among them — rely on Forter to get this right. Since 2013, we&#39;ve raised $525M from investors including Tiger Global, Bessemer, Sequoia Capital, and Salesforce Ventures, and today we power commerce decisions for nearly 1 million businesses globally. We&#39;re more than fraud, payments and orchestration – we make trust a competitive advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust is backed by data –&amp;nbsp; Forter is a recipient of over 10 workplace and innovation awards, including:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work Certification (2021, 2022, 2023, 2024,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.com/certified-company/7039960&quot;&gt; 2025&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fortune’s Best Workplaces in NYC (2022, 2023, 2024 and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.com/best-workplaces/new-york/2024?category=small-and-medium&quot;&gt; 2025&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Forbes Cloud 100 (2021, 2022, 2023, 2024 and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/lists/cloud100/?sh=5675f5797d9c&quot;&gt;2025&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Anti-Fraud Solution of the Year at the Payments Awards (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.payments-awards.com/awards/winners24.php&quot;&gt;2024&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life as a Forterian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Forterians are, genuinely, some of the best people you&#39;ll work with. Smart, curious, and deeply good humans who care about the work and each other. That&#39;s not an accident — it&#39;s something we&#39;ve been intentional about since day one, and it&#39;s the thing people mention most when they talk about why they stay. When you&#39;re surrounded by people like this, doing work that actually matters, it changes what a job can feel like.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Forter was built on a simple but powerful conviction: when AI does its job, humans can do theirs better. That philosophy shapes our products and shapes how we work. AI is core to our workflows — not as a shortcut, but as a force multiplier that gives Forterians the space to focus their energy where human judgment is irreplaceable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re a global team of 500+ people, with regional headquarters in New York, Tel Aviv, London, and Singapore, and employee presence across the US, Canada, Germany, France, Japan, China, and Australia. Our teams are cross-functional by design, and the work you do here is visible, consequential, and connected to the outcomes that matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll have real ownership here and proximity to decisions. And we back that with investment in your growth — RSU offerings, L&amp;amp;D programs built around AI tools, and a culture of recognition rooted in our 4.5 day weeks (aka Forter’s Appreciation Fridays and Sundays). From team outings to local cultural celebrations, we mark the moments that matter — wherever you are in the world. We don&#39;t want Forter to be just another job. We want it to be the place you build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re ready to work on a problem that sits at the intersection of AI, commerce, and human trust, this is it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Forter is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that will consider all qualified applicants, regardless of race, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, marital status, gender identity or expression, national origin, genetics, age, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, please email us at ----- This information will be treated as confidential and used only for the purpose of determining an appropriate accommodation for the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Matching 401K Plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive and generous health insurance, including vision and dental coverage &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Home office allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Half day Fridays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Forter, we embrace a hybrid work model that blends in-person connection with the flexibility of remote work. Team members based near our key hubs are expected to work from the office at least three days per week. We believe that regular face-to-face collaboration fuels professional development, strengthens our culture, and builds the relationships that help teams thrive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forter.com/job-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Forter&#39;s Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forter.com/job-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Forter&#39;s Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Solutions Architect - Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services is hiring a Global Solutions Architect to serve as our most senior technical authority for public cloud. This is a global, individual-contributor role at Technical Director level. You will set the architectural direction for how Rubrik is designed, deployed, and operated in the world’s most demanding cloud environments, and you will carry that direction personally into our most strategic customer engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be deployed where technical risk is highest: flagship accounts, first-of-a-kind architectures, and the engagements whose outcome sets the pattern everyone else follows. Between those engagements, you will convert what you learned into the reference architectures, service offerings, and enablement that raise the capability of every architect and consultant in the field. Your impact is measured by the quality of the practice you leave behind, not the hours you personally bill.&lt;br&gt;We are looking for depth in public cloud architecture first. Deep Rubrik product expertise is expected to be built on the job. If you have architected large-scale data, storage, or security platforms across AWS, Azure, and GCP, and you can learn a new platform quickly and completely, we want to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global cloud architecture standard for Rubrik Professional Services, reference architectures, design patterns, guardrails, and documented anti-patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final technical escalation point for cloud architecture decisions on strategic engagements worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical shape of our cloud service offerings: what we sell, how it is scoped, and what good delivery looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish Rubrik PS’s position on emerging cloud capabilities and translate them into deployment guidance before customers ask&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the hardest engagements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own architecture and design on the most complex, highest-visibility customer engagements globally, multi-region, multi-cloud, and multi-regulator estates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as trusted advisor to customer CIO, CTO, Chief Architect, and CISO stakeholders, and defend design decisions in front of customer architecture review boards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Pre-Sales on strategic pursuits: technical validation, level of effort, and honest risk assessment on the deals we cannot afford to get wrong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead briefings and multi-day design workshops on site and remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale yourself through the practice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the intellectual property that multiplies your reach, reference architectures, deployment automation, design templates, decision trees, and delivery accelerators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and technically develop Solutions Architects and senior consultants across all theatres; raise the ceiling of the practice, not just your own output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define technical competency standards and enablement for cloud within Professional Services, and help set the hiring bar through technical interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Rubrik Professional Services externally at conferences, customer advisory boards, and in published technical material&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence the product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the field’s most credible voice into Product Management and Engineering, backed by evidence from our largest deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape roadmap priorities, supportability, and cloud-native feature direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Support and Customer Success on systemic technical issues before they become patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with PS Operations and leadership to turn field learning into better scoping models, estimates, and delivery methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15+ years overall experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including 8+ years as a handson cloud architect at enterprise scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated ownership of architecture&lt;/strong&gt; for multi-region, multi-account or multi-subscription cloud estates, in a large enterprise or a consulting / professional services organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert-level AWS and Azure&lt;/strong&gt;; GCP strongly preferred. Genuine depth across compute, storage, networking, identity, and encryption / key management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding of enterprise data protection and cyber resilience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;RTO and RPO modelling, immutability, backup and recovery design, isolated and air-gapped recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working fluency in cloud security and compliance frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; and how they constrain design in regulated industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong automation background&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; infrastructure as code (Terraform, CloudFormation, Bicep), scripting (Python, PowerShell), API-first integration, and CI/CD (Strong Automation Background)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record of influence without authority&lt;/strong&gt; across a global, matrixed organization and multiple time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive-grade communication&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; credible with a customer’s CIO and their principal engineer on the same day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidence of building reusable technical IP&lt;/strong&gt;, not only delivering successful projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ability to learn a complex new platform to expert depth, quickly.&lt;/strong&gt; Prior Rubrik experience is not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Occasional travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes and containerized workload architecture; cloud-native and managed database platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS data protection experience (Microsoft 365, Salesforce, and similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Principal, Distinguished, or Technical Director title within a vendor professional services organization or a major systems integrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional or expert-level certifications (AWS Solutions Architect – Professional, Azure Solutions Architect Expert, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established public technical presence — talks, writing, open source, or community leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Abnormal AI is looking for a Senior Customer Trust Analyst to build and lead our customer-trust program across EMEA. As the first Customer Trust hire in the region, this person will partner closely with our EMEA-based Engineering and Sales teams to foster a culture of trust between Abnormal and our customers. This role sits within the Customer Trust team, which acts as the translation layer between customers and Abnormal: translating customer security requirements into internal controls, evidence, and product or operational requirements, then translating those controls back into clear assurances customers can trust and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be responsible for presenting Abnormal&#39;s control environment directly to senior buyers, designing response strategy for the highest-stakes security reviews rather than reacting question by question, and driving toward clarity when customer expectations conflict with reality. This includes advising Sales leadership on how to position the control environment to prospects and defining how the trust response process scales as deal volume grows. As the first person in this function regionally, this individual will serve as the primary point of contact for Abnormal&#39;s EMEA customer-trust program and will be accountable for outcomes that unblock revenue at scale, not just individual deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate thrives in high-pressure customer conversations, translates security and privacy concepts for a business audience with precision, stays composed when a discussion turns contentious, and brings the business judgment to tie trust program depth to revenue outcomes. Familiarity with the EU AI Act and GDPR as they apply to a leading cybersecurity SaaS provider&#39;s customers is also expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience navigating customer-facing security conversations at the highest stakes level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical thinker who connects trust program depth to revenue outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in designing a response strategy rather than reacting question by question, even amid high ambiguity in the highest-stakes reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence and willingness to raise concerns and drive toward clarity when customer expectations conflict with reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to quickly build rapport with internal stakeholders and senior external buyers; demonstrated experience translating complex security and privacy concepts for diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and process, with the organizational rigor to be accountable for program-level outcomes, not just individual deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to evolving business and technical environments and manage multiple priorities across deals in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player, collaborative work style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and able to operate with minimal oversight, owning outcomes end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate as a self-starter and de facto leader, building a customer-trust function from the ground up as the first hire in a region, and comfortable navigating cross-functionally to manage customer requests without an established local team or playbook to lean on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and build the customer-trust program for EMEA as the first Customer Trust hire in the region, including how conversations are prioritized, escalated, and resolved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to defining how the trust response process scales as deal volume grows, without diluting response quality or turnaround time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer security requirements into internal controls, evidence, and product or operational requirements that internal teams can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and drive resolution of gaps between customer expectations and Abnormal&#39;s actual control environment, ensuring resolution is documented and communicated back to the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with EMEA-based Engineering and Sales teams, as well as Security and Legal, to foster a culture of trust between Abnormal and its customers across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor changes in customer expectations and the regulatory landscape, including the EU AI Act and GDPR, and adjust how Abnormal&#39;s control environment is presented as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date content in Responsive and accurate documentation in Safebase Trust Center for EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the tooling that underpins the trust response process, including Responsive and Safebase Trust Center&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in ad-hoc projects as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain regular, clear communication with internal stakeholders and Sales leadership regarding conversation status, deal risk, and progress on unresolved issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate program status, health, and key risks to senior management and Sales leadership, connecting trust program performance to revenue outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must Haves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 to 10 years of experience in customer-facing security, trust, or compliance roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SOC 2, ISO 27001, ISO 27701, ISO 42001, RFPs, and security questionnaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating customer security requirements into internal controls, evidence, and product or operational requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to drive resolution across internal teams when customer expectations conflict with reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain complex security and privacy concepts to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping customers build trust with products in scope for the EU AI Act and GDPR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging with German works councils&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CIPP/E, CIPM, CISM, CISSP, CTPRP, or ISO 27001 Lead Auditor certification(s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Responsive and SafeBase Trust Center&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced, high-growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on AI in our process:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Abnormal AI uses AI-assisted tools to help our recruiting team prepare for candidate interviews. These tools analyze resume content and role requirements to suggest interview questions and areas for the interviewer to explore.They do not make hiring decisions or screen candidates automatically. Every decision about a candidacy is made by a person. Further, if your application is successful and Abnormal AI makes a conditional offer of employment, we will carry out pre-employment checks which must be successfully completed to progress to a final offer. All processes and pre-employment checks are in line with prevailing legislation and Abnormal AI&#39;s policies relevant to our security and privacy standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Abnormal AI is an equal opportunity employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, protected veteran status or other characteristics protected by law. For our EEO policy statement please &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt3a076cfd9753fa1f/blt9cbda641db7c0045/6a1e3d3a66aea075cd33e462/AAP_and_EEO_Statement.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;click here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. If you would like more information on your EEO rights under the law, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt3a076cfd9753fa1f/blt4eb3a265cc7b1ca9/6a1e3d3bfe33e73c16ff026b/EEOC_Know_Your_Rights_Oct_30_2025.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering Tailscale. If this job description resonates with you, please apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Frequently cited statistics show that people who identify with historically marginalized groups are likely to apply to jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We encourage you to help us break that statistic!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tailscale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tailscale is making safe connection effortless by delivering software that makes it easy to securely interconnect people and their devices, no matter where they are. From hobbyists to multinational corporations, teams of every size use Tailscale each day to protect their networks, share access to internal tools, and more. We&#39;re building a future for the Internet that&#39;s easy, sensible, and safe, like it used to be. Founded in 2019 and fully distributed, we&#39;re backed by Accel, CRV, Insight, Heavybit, and Uncork Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a talented and motivated full-time Software Engineer, AI Enablement to help Tailscale&#39;s engineering organization get the most out of AI-assisted development. You&#39;ll join a small, high-leverage team reporting to our co-founder, working alongside our first AI enablement engineer to build the tools, workflows, and practices that help every engineer at Tailscale build faster and more safely with AI. This is a foundational role — you&#39;ll have real latitude to shape what AI enablement means here as we scale, with direct visibility into how the whole engineering org adopts these tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering leadership and Tailscale&#39;s technical staff to define and drive our internal AI-enablement roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the team building Aperture by Tailscale, our AI gateway used both internally and offered as a product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and iterate on the tools, workflows, and shared practices that help engineers get real value from coding agents — and evaluate new models and tools, making clear calls on what we adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering and non-engineering teams to find high-leverage opportunities to apply AI — this is a support function, so success means other teams shipping faster because of what you&#39;ve built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the guardrails, review practices, and documentation that make AI-generated code safe to ship, and act as the internal advocate who helps teams adopt good practices without mandating a single tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track adoption and measure the real impact of AI tooling on velocity and quality, and report back to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine, daily, hands-on fluency with modern AI coding tools (Claude Code, Codex, Pi, or similar) — real power-user experience, not occasional use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and shipping internal tools or developer-facing automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication and internal advocacy skills — comfortable teaching, writing, and influencing engineers at very different comfort levels with AI tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A balanced approach — trying to get people to use AI effectively and safely where appropriate. We don&#39;t have an &#39;AI mandate&#39;; we believe that if we make AI both easy to use and safe, people will choose to use it when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and self-directed prioritization on a small, still-forming team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product or systems thinking — able to identify and prioritize high-leverage opportunities, not just execute a pre-set roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in developer experience, platform engineering, or internal tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating or benchmarking LLMs and coding agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a systems language such as Go or Rust, in addition to Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in security or code-review practices — helpful for reasoning about AI/agent-generated code, though you don&#39;t need to be a security engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in developer relations, technical evangelism, or customer-facing developer advocacy — the same skills that make someone effective in external DevRel translate well to driving internal AI adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical project management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a company, we strive to maintain fair and equitable compensation practices within our team across all roles and all levels. Tailscale&#39;s compensation package includes base salary, equity, and comprehensive benefits. The salary range displayed on each job posting represents the target range for a new hire&#39;s base salary. Individual offers may vary based on experience and skill set.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£128,770&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£178,540 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An inclusive, flexible environment where you can be your authentic self.&lt;/strong&gt; We recognize the impact of diverse voices and backgrounds on the growth of our people, product, and company. And that flexibility in how and when you work empowers our team to integrate work and life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A competitive total compensation package.&lt;/strong&gt; This includes a base salary, an equity incentive plan and variable commission (for quota-based roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive group benefits with no waiting period. &lt;/strong&gt;Take advantage of coverage for health, vision, dental, and more for you and your family!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote first company&lt;/strong&gt;—most of our teams work fully remotely. Enjoy a change of scenery wherever you can get wifi, participate in virtual and in-person social events, and leverage our corporate co-working program to visit WeWork (or other similar spaces near you). Some roles require in-office collaboration depending on team needs, which will be clearly noted in the job description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer-funded retirement contributions. &lt;/strong&gt;Tailscale will match your retirement contributions dollar-for-dollar, up to a maximum annual employer contribution equal to 0.75% of your eligible compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect with other Tailscalars IRL. &lt;/strong&gt;Attend our annual company retreat, participate in team off-sites, and collaborate in person with teammates across Canada, the United States, the United Kingdom, and Singapore. We support intentional in-person connection through team travel and distributed collaboration.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support for your personal and professional development.&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your career thoughtfully with $1500 USD annually for professional development, or take advantage of mentorship, coaching, and internal promotion opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off and a healthy work-life integration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Our flexible, paid time off program supports you for any situation life throws your way, whether moving homes or travelling the world!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A build-your-own home office setup. &lt;/strong&gt;You choose your own company-owned laptop (Mac or PC), receive a monthly home internet reimbursement, and $500 USD to customize your workstation to make it your own.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave program&lt;/strong&gt;. We care about your life outside of work and encourage new parents to take advantage of parental leave top-ups (20 weeks for birthing parents, 16 weeks for non-birthing parents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tailscale is committed to providing an accessible and inclusive hiring process. If you require an accommodation at any stage of the recruitment process or related to any aspect of this role, please contact your recruiter.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our hiring process uses AI-assisted tools to help screen and assess candidates. All hiring decisions are made by people.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware that legitimate emails from Tailscale&#39;s talent team will only originate from ----- ----- and ----- email addresses. For more information about protecting yourself from impersonators and scams, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://tailscale.com/scam-awareness&quot;&gt;https://tailscale.com/scam-awareness&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_1770241969069985273m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.coreweave.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.coreweave.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1762613132717000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3D-UOhNaqEvF5BEWxjYyAU&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Physical AI Engineering Team&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;CoreWeave&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for building and scaling the core platform that powers the world’s most advanced engineering simulation and AI workflows. From evolving distributed architecture to enabling the next generation of agentic applications and physical AI, this team delivers the performant, reliable, and scalable foundation trusted by the world’s largest engineering companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a Staff Software Engineer to help drive the architectural evolution of our platform as we scale to meet growing demand from the world’s largest engineering companies. This is a hands-on technical leadership role where you’ll drive critical architectural initiatives across the full software lifecycle – from design and testing to deployment, operations, and reliability – while mentoring our engineering team. Partnering with senior engineering leadership, you’ll help shape and execute our platform’s evolution to a more distributed architecture, making it agentic ready for the next generation of AI applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the ongoing transition from monolithic to distributed architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement architecture to be agentic ready, enabling rapid deployment of AI products and MCP server integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical decisions balancing immediate business needs with long-term architectural goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write production-quality Python code for critical platform components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize distributed compute services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement reliable workflow orchestration patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own CI/CD pipelines, automated testing, and deployment strategy for platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reliability, observability, and SRE practices (monitoring, alerting, incident response, performance and scaling).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Mentorship &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior and mid-level engineers, elevating the technical capabilities of the entire team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish engineering best practices and architectural patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product and business stakeholders to translate requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide technical decision-making and prioritization across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview and onboard new engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience, including time in a staff-level engineering role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad software engineering depth spanning deployment and CI/CD, automated testing, and SRE/production reliability (observability, incident response).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in distributed systems architecture, including building and operating large-scale distributed backend systems end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong API and service interface design skills for distributed services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security-minded development, including authentication/authorization (e.g., OAuth) and secure-by-default practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level Python development skills with production experience at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Kubernetes experience with production workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with workflow orchestration tools (Temporal, Airflow, Kubeflow, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud platform expertise (AWS required, Azure &amp;amp; GCP beneficial).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data processing frameworks (Spark, Athena, Ray, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving architectural transformations in growing companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellence in technical communication and stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren’t a 100% skill or experience match. &lt;/strong&gt;Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;You write clean, maintainable code and design systems that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; You care about testing, deployments, and what happens after code ships – reliability, monitoring, and on-call health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Problem-Solver: &lt;/strong&gt;You balance perfectionism with shipping, making smart trade-offs between short-term delivery and long-term goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;You proactively identify problems and drive solutions forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You elevate others through knowledge sharing and patient guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership Mentality: &lt;/strong&gt;You take full responsibility for outcomes and drive initiatives to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Obsession: &lt;/strong&gt;You understand that our success is measured by our customers’ success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast!&amp;nbsp; We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and enables the development of innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the organization&#39;s growth opportunities are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range we’ve posted represents the typical compensation range for this role. To determine actual compensation, we review the market rate for each candidate which can include a variety of factors. These include qualifications, experience, interview performance, and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs. The benefits below reflect our US-based offerings for full-time employees; for roles in other locations, benefits vary and are shared during the hiring process. These include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance - 100% paid for by CoreWeave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary supplemental life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short and long-term disability insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Savings Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to Participate in Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellness Benefits through Spring Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Forming support provided by Carrot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, full-service childcare support with Kinside&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with a generous employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch each day in our office and data center locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A casual work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Applicants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gPBRBhUNAMBmj7Yn4_M-hCugm7ZJD4hr/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Consumer Privacy Act&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity &amp;amp; Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of this commitment and consistent with the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/laws/guidance/fact-sheet-disability-discrimination&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, CoreWeave will ensure that qualified applicants and candidates with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations for the hiring process, unless such accommodation would cause an undue hardship. If reasonable accommodation is needed, please contact: &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_1770241969069985273m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.coreweave.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.coreweave.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1762613132717000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3D-UOhNaqEvF5BEWxjYyAU&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Experience (CX) Organization at CoreWeave is dedicated to ensuring every client running AI workloads at scale has a seamless, reliable, and high-performance experience. This team supports the infrastructure that powers the AI revolution—working across data centers, hardware systems, and customer workloads to maintain the integrity of our cloud platform. The CX organization aligns closely with the internal and customer engineering teams, offering valuable insights from the field and having the chance to contribute to the CoreWeave product roadmap and development.&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;CoreWeave runs some of the largest GPU clusters in the world, and the network has a lot to do with how well they perform. As a Senior Specialist Field Engineer for Networking, you&#39;ll help customers get the most from the GPU fabric, the front-end network, and the links between data centers. You&#39;ll work closely with the Networking product and engineering teams, and what you learn in the field will help shape what they build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design network architecture for complex customers (multi-cloud, multi-region, hybrid Kubernetes, bare metal, Direct Connect), including how it fails and what each failure affects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot problems that span many nodes and VPCs, from the Linux kernel and the CNI up through the data-center fabric and HPC interconnects (InfiniBand, RoCE).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Find where the product falls short for real workloads and work the gap through with engineering, as an extended member of the Networking team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead customer technical overviews, proofs of concept, and customer workshops, with occasional travel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;B.S. in Computer Science or a related technical discipline, or equivalent experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;7+ years building or operating large-scale networks, as a network, systems, or software engineer, or in a deeply technical networking-focused field role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Solid working knowledge of network protocols such as BGP, VXLAN/EVPN, and DNS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of Kubernetes networking, including CNIs such as Cilium or Calico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Expertise in cloud connectivity: VPCs, peering, dedicated interconnects, and VPNs such as WireGuard or Tailscale, and the trade-offs between them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Very comfortable going below the tooling to analyze packet captures, kernel routing tables, interface and fabric counters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You explain technical problems clearly to engineers and executives, and you build trust with customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Expertise with InfiniBand and RoCE, including fabric diagnostics, subnet management, and partition-based tenant isolation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with NVIDIA GPUs, especially GB200/GB300 platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;First-principles debugging through the Linux kernel network stack, eBPF, FRR, and OVS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Diagnosing distributed failures across hundreds of nodes, such as ECMP blackholing across fabric planes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Large Direct Connect designs: per-VPC BGP sessions, prefix strategy, and cloud provider limits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contributions to networking open source (kernel, FRR, Cilium, OVS) or published work on fabric design or network debugging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;d rather look at a packet capture than guess.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;re comfortable saying &quot;I don&#39;t know yet,&quot; and then you go find out.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You like working on a hard problem alongside the customer and the engineering team, and you share the credit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast!&amp;nbsp; We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and provides the opportunity to develop innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for take off, the growth opportunities within the organization are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range we’ve posted represents the typical compensation range for this role. To determine actual compensation, we review the market rate for each candidate which can include a variety of factors. These include qualifications, experience, interview performance, and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs. The benefits below reflect our US-based offerings for full-time employees; for roles in other locations, benefits vary and are shared during the hiring process. These include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance - 100% paid for by CoreWeave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary supplemental life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short and long-term disability insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Savings Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to Participate in Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellness Benefits through Spring Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Forming support provided by Carrot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, full-service childcare support with Kinside&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with a generous employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch each day in our office and data center locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A casual work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Applicants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gPBRBhUNAMBmj7Yn4_M-hCugm7ZJD4hr/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Consumer Privacy Act&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity &amp;amp; Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of this commitment and consistent with the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/laws/guidance/fact-sheet-disability-discrimination&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, CoreWeave will ensure that qualified applicants and candidates with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations for the hiring process, unless such accommodation would cause an undue hardship. If reasonable accommodation is needed, please contact: &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_1770241969069985273m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.coreweave.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.coreweave.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1762613132717000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3D-UOhNaqEvF5BEWxjYyAU&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Physical AI Engineering Team&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;CoreWeave&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for building and scaling the core platform that powers the world’s most advanced engineering simulation and AI workflows. From evolving distributed architecture to enabling the next generation of agentic applications and physical AI, this team delivers the performant, reliable, and scalable foundation trusted by the world’s largest engineering companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a Senior Software Engineer to help build and scale our platform as we meet growing demand from the world’s largest engineering companies. This is a hands-on engineering role where you’ll deliver critical features and services across the full software lifecycle – from design and testing to deployment, operations, and reliability. You’ll contribute to our platform’s evolution to a more distributed architecture, helping make it agentic ready for the next generation of AI applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the ongoing transition from monolithic to distributed architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design and implement architecture to be agentic ready, enabling rapid deployment of AI products and MCP server integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sound technical decisions for the components you own, balancing immediate needs with long-term goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write production-quality Python code for critical platform components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize distributed compute services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement reliable workflow orchestration patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to CI/CD pipelines, automated testing, and deployment for platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reliability, observability, and SRE practices (monitoring, alerting, incident response, performance and scaling).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Mentorship &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and mentor engineers, sharing knowledge across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow and help improve engineering best practices and patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product and engineering peers to turn requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical decision-making and prioritization within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview and onboard new engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of software engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid software engineering breadth across deployment and CI/CD, automated testing, and production reliability (observability, incident response).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems, building and operating backend services end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing APIs and service interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security-minded development, including authentication/authorization (e.g., OAuth) and secure-by-default practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python development skills with production experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow orchestration tools (Temporal, Airflow, Kubeflow, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud platform experience (AWS preferred, Azure &amp;amp; GCP a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data processing frameworks (Spark, Athena, Ray, or similar) a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren’t a 100% skill or experience match. &lt;/strong&gt;Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;You write clean, maintainable code and design systems that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; You care about testing, deployments, and what happens after code ships – reliability, monitoring, and on-call health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Problem-Solver: &lt;/strong&gt;You balance perfectionism with shipping, making smart trade-offs between short-term delivery and long-term goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;You proactively identify problems and drive solutions forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You elevate others through knowledge sharing and patient guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership Mentality: &lt;/strong&gt;You take full responsibility for outcomes and drive initiatives to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Obsession: &lt;/strong&gt;You understand that our success is measured by our customers’ success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast!&amp;nbsp; We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and enables the development of innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the organization&#39;s growth opportunities are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range we’ve posted represents the typical compensation range for this role. To determine actual compensation, we review the market rate for each candidate which can include a variety of factors. These include qualifications, experience, interview performance, and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs. The benefits below reflect our US-based offerings for full-time employees; for roles in other locations, benefits vary and are shared during the hiring process. These include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance - 100% paid for by CoreWeave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary supplemental life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short and long-term disability insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Savings Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to Participate in Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellness Benefits through Spring Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Forming support provided by Carrot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, full-service childcare support with Kinside&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with a generous employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch each day in our office and data center locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A casual work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Applicants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gPBRBhUNAMBmj7Yn4_M-hCugm7ZJD4hr/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Consumer Privacy Act&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity &amp;amp; Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of this commitment and consistent with the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/laws/guidance/fact-sheet-disability-discrimination&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, CoreWeave will ensure that qualified applicants and candidates with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations for the hiring process, unless such accommodation would cause an undue hardship. If reasonable accommodation is needed, please contact: &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_1770241969069985273m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.coreweave.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.coreweave.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1762613132717000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3D-UOhNaqEvF5BEWxjYyAU&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The infrastructure powering the AI era doesn’t sell itself, and the customers building on it don’t want to be sold to. They want a peer. You’ll work as part of a focused three-person team alongside one Account Executive and one Account Manager, together responsible for landing new accounts and expanding within them across the region. The customers you’ll work with are AI labs, research institutions, and enterprises running some of the most demanding GPU workloads in the world. This is a role for someone who shows up with substance, who can hold a real conversation about model training and MLOps tooling in the morning and cluster networking in the afternoon, and who finds the space between infrastructure and application more interesting than either on its own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Solution Architect covering Northern EMEA, you’ll move across the full stack depending on what the customer needs, from ML training workflows and MLOps platforms like Weights &amp;amp; Biases to bare metal GPU infrastructure and physical AI deployments. This isn’t a role built around a single layer of the stack, but the majority of your conversations will live in the ML layer. You’ll be expected to go deeper than most when the infrastructure conversation demands it, while staying commercially aware enough to support both new logo pursuits and in-flight account expansion. This role requires up to 40% travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cover Northern EMEA, with a focus on the Nordics and Benelux regions (Sweden, Norway, Denmark, Finland, Netherlands, Belgium, and Luxembourg).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with one Account Executive and one Account Manager as a dedicated three-person unit, supporting the full land and expand motion across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery with prospects and existing customers to understand model training requirements, MLOps workflows, and infrastructure constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and present solutions spanning ML infrastructure, GPU compute, storage, networking, Kubernetes-based orchestration, and MLOps tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run proof-of-concept engagements and architecture reviews, and see them through to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the internal voice of the customer, feeding technical requirements and product gaps back to Engineering and Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear documentation of customer architectures, solution designs, and outstanding technical questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a pre-sales, solutions engineering, or solutions architecture role, ideally with a focus on AI/ML platforms, cloud infrastructure, or HPC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of ML training and inference workflows - you understand how models are built, optimized, and deployed, not just where they run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with MLOps platforms and the tooling AI teams use day-to-day, including experiment tracking, pipeline orchestration, and model serving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI frameworks such as PyTorch, TensorFlow, or JAX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable going below the SaaS layer when the conversation demands it - GPU topology, network fabric, and cluster architecture shouldn’t be unfamiliar territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Kubernetes and containerized workloads at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills - you can adjust your register from a research engineer to a VP of Infrastructure without losing credibility at either end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple concurrent opportunities across a geographic territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; proficiency in Dutch, Swedish, Norwegian, Danish, or Finnish is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with NVIDIA GPU architectures (H100, A100, H200) and the software stack around them: CUDA, NCCL, cuDNN.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of high-performance networking concepts: InfiniBand, RDMA, RoCE, TCP/IP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working directly with AI labs, research institutions, or enterprise ML teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to physical AI use cases and the infrastructure requirements they bring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce, Jira, Confluence, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams - even if you aren’t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable going one layer deeper than the demo - whether that’s a networking topology, a training job that won’t converge, or a rack layout question from a facilities team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked across more than one layer of the stack and find the intersections more interesting than any single discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a fast-moving environment and take ownership of your region like it’s your own business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a natural collaborator who makes the people around you - including your AE and AM - better at their jobs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
