&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be visionary, strategic, and open to innovation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build great things&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work in service of our users, always improving and pushing higher&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate like an owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take responsibility with bold decision-making and bias for action&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win like a sports team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be trusting and collaborative while empowering others&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow fast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Never stop learning and iterate fast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Share our passion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share ideas and practice enthusiasm and joy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be user obsessed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Empathetic, inquisitive, practical&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;ui-markdown__heading ui-13ebx5f ui-x6cpbe ui-14l7nz5 ui-zboxd6 ui-2rll1g ui-1pz8kdr ui-1rrfizd ui-1qaq26d&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ui-markdown__paragraph ui-z80ra4 ui-uu7i3w ui-1nhcn8o ui-j7cesy ui-13faqbe ui-14l7nz5 ui-zboxd6 ui-1xxm6qq ui-fo6hhr&quot; data-md-next=&quot;list&quot;&gt;We&#39;re building some of our newest AI products at Good Systems, and we need creative, hands-on, AI-native marketers who can take a product from zero to its first users. You&#39;ll find the channels that work and scale them. You&#39;ll own acquisition end to end (positioning, messaging, launch, channels, creative) and do much of the work yourself, using AI to move at a pace a traditional team can&#39;t. This is a huge opportunity to be a key driving force behind our newest AI bets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ui-markdown__list ui-78zum5 ui-dt5ytf ui-1ae8yn7 ui-13vk20g ui-1e8yfua ui-j7cesy ui-1bae07f&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ui-markdown__list-item ui--default-marker ui-exx8yu ui-1xpa7k ui-18d9i69 ui-1uhho1l ui-13faqbe ui-ez2fb&quot; data-md-list-item=&quot;&quot;&gt;This role will be required to work on-site, 4 days per week in our London Paddington office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ui-markdown__list-item ui--default-marker ui-exx8yu ui-1xpa7k ui-18d9i69 ui-1uhho1l ui-13faqbe ui-ez2fb&quot; data-md-list-item=&quot;&quot;&gt;This is a 12-month fixed term contract, renewable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ui-markdown__list-item ui--default-marker ui-exx8yu ui-1xpa7k ui-18d9i69 ui-1uhho1l ui-13faqbe ui-ez2fb&quot; data-md-list-item=&quot;&quot;&gt;This role does not include visa sponsorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;ui-markdown__heading ui-13ebx5f ui-x6cpbe ui-14l7nz5 ui-zboxd6 ui-2rll1g ui-1pz8kdr ui-1rrfizd ui-1qaq26d&quot;&gt;This is the role for you if you&#39;re excited to work on:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with channels and tactics, and learn fast what&#39;s worth investing in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initial traction for a brand-new product with little budget and no built-in audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run acquisition loops across content, social, creators, community, partnerships, referral and paid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape positioning and messaging for products still taking form, and test them in market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce copy, landing pages, video, creative, outreach and analysis yourself, and know when to bring in specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up your own funnel measurement and run weekly experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed what you learn back to Product and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re creative, hands-on and happy to get into the weeds, take ownership and experiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve taken a product from 0 to its first users and can show exactly how&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re T-shaped: deep in one or two channels, competent across the rest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI daily and can name specifically what it replaced in your workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity, think in numbers and write well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Would be helpful but not required:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have prosumer or PLG experience, plus creator and community experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build in public and have an online presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seniority matters less than mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The interview process:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Intro Call:&lt;/strong&gt; A conversation with our Talent Acquisition team to dive into your experience, what motivates you, and why you&#39;re interested in joining Goodnotes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; A deeper dive into your professional background, your preferred ways of working, and the specific impact you&#39;ll have within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role-Specific Assessment:&lt;/strong&gt; A live session in our London Paddington office, focused on the core skills for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Values-Based Panel Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; A conversation with 2-3 team members centred on our company values. We&#39;ll discuss past experiences to see how your approach aligns with our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; As an AI-first company, we&#39;ll meet with one of our AI champions to discuss your curiosity, understanding, and practical use of AI tools in your daily workflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customized Growth &amp;amp; Wellness Budgets:&lt;/strong&gt; We provide dedicated stipends for the things that keep you at your best, including noise-cancelling headphones for deep focus, professional training, personal development, and health and wellness activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Connectivity:&lt;/strong&gt; While we embrace flexible work, we love seeing each other. We provide sponsored visits to our beautiful office locations to foster face-to-face collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company-Wide Offsites:&lt;/strong&gt; Once a year, we gather the entire global team in person to celebrate our wins, align on our vision, and build lasting connections.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Health Coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Your well-being is our priority. We offer premium medical insurance for you and a dependent to ensure peace of mind for you and your family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4 days in-office hybrid week and 18 remote working days per year:&lt;/strong&gt; Giving you the freedom to work from a location that suits your life. Whether that&#39;s closer to family, while travelling, or simply a change of scenery to refresh your focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Goodnotes is committed to fostering a diverse, inclusive, and equitable workplace. We welcome applications from individuals of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences, making all employment decisions based strictly on merit, qualifications, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Employment is contingent upon successful completion of background checks, including verification of employment, education, and criminal records.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1752137170.022319&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1752137170.022319&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__background c-message_kit__background--hovered p-message_pane_message__message c-message_kit__message&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_container&quot; data-qa-unprocessed=&quot;false&quot; data-qa-placeholder=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__hover c-message_kit__hover--hovered&quot; data-qa-hover=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__actions c-message_kit__actions--default&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter__right&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that you have read and understood our Candidate Privacy Notice, which provides important information about the data we collect during the application process. You can find it &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.goodnotes.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This position brings together a defined set of responsibilities into a single point of coordination, ensuring the team continues to respond effectively to commercial and trade priorities across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role acts as the connective layer across marketing channels: building visibility on what each channel owner is delivering, translating trade and commercial priorities into marketing action, and representing Global Marketing in trade conversations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a newly created, fixed-term role designed to provide focused trade and commercial marketing support to the Global Marketing team during a period of maternity leave cover. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Trade &amp;amp; Commercial Marketing Coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Represent Global Marketing at trade meetings, feeding commercial business priorities back into the marketing team and translating them into appropriate marketing actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as the central point of visibility across all marketing channels — working with each channel owner to understand current activity, upcoming plans and performance, so the wider business has a clear, single view of what&#39;s happening to support trade and commercial needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:504,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide a first point of contact for the business on marketing-related trade queries, escalating and prioritising as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Operations Marketing (F&amp;amp;B)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as the global point of contact for Operations marketing, supporting F&amp;amp;B initiatives designed to maximise revenue and footfall across Soho Houses globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with House and Operations teams to shape marketing support for commercial trading priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bedrooms Marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work closely with the global Bedrooms team on the commercial and brand marketing plan, covering both long-term positioning and short-term tactical activity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage Google paid channels for Soho House bedrooms, including Metasearch, Performance Max (PMax) and Demand Gen campaigns, optimising spend and performance against commercial targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Web &amp;amp; SEO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Oversee Web and SEO projects on sohohouse.com, with a particular focus on optimising membership acquisition and application journeys.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with digital and web teams to prioritise projects that improve conversion through the membership funnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Performance Insight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Interpret and quantify data to report on performance across marketing channels, translating results into clear, actionable insight for the wider team and business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Maintain consistent reporting rhythms so channel performance is easy to track and communicate across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:504,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Team Efficiency &amp;amp; AI Enablement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:504,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:288,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on support to the marketing team in using Claude (or equivalent AI tools) to optimise and streamline day-to-day output, sharing practical ways of working that save time across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:320,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proven experience across multi-channel marketing, ideally spanning both brand/commercial marketing and performance/paid media.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience managing Google paid channels (Metasearch, PMax, Demand Gen) — bedrooms, travel or hospitality experience is an advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong working knowledge of SEO and web optimisation, particularly around acquisition and conversion journeys.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Confident interpreting data and translating it into clear commercial narratives for varied audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Comfortable representing marketing in trade/commercial conversations, challenging assumptions and translating business priorities into marketing plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A natural project coordinator — able to build a clear, accurate view of activity across multiple channels and stakeholders without owning every channel directly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience using AI tools (e.g. Claude) to improve team efficiency is a strong plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Line management experience, or readiness to step into managing 3 direct reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
