&lt;p&gt;● 26 days holiday&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Flexible bank holidays, giving you an additional 8 days which you can choose to take whenever you like&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Progressive leave policies with no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Dedicated personal learning and home office budgets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● And more…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
