&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;72d9cead-5d7c-511f-a089-41bc1b2ad175|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[335559740,&amp;quot;253&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Arial,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;Body text Optiver&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;BodytextOptiver&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Zsysbasis Optiver&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Are you looking for a role where your&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and judgement &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;make a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;real impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;? Do you enjoy &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;working &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;close&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;ly&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; the business, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;taking&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;translating &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;complex regulatory requirements into practical solutions?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Join &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Optiver&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; Compliance team in London and play a key role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; supporting our growing Institutional Sales &amp;amp; Trading &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;. You will work directly with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;stakeholders across the firm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;a broad range of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;regulatory, conduct and financial crime matters, while&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; contributing to the development &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;of the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; Global Compliance framework &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;as the business continues to evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
