&lt;li&gt;Collect and analyze learning KPIs (completion rates, engagement, skill-gap data) and translate them into clear dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support learning needs assessments through data analysis (skill matrices, team-level training gaps)&lt;/li&gt;
