&lt;li&gt;Support the organization and execution of training sessions and feedback cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in L&amp;amp;D, HR analytics, HR controlling, or another data-heavy role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience building or administering an LMS (e.g., Personio, Docebo, TalentLMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong command of Google Sheets and data-driven decisions in an L&amp;amp;D context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical, structured approach with a self-directed way of working in a remote-first environment&lt;/li&gt;
