&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Story&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At thinkcell, we create powerful software solutions that help professionals be more efficient and productive. Founded in 2002 and based in Berlin, our tools integrate seamlessly with Microsoft Office to help users create presentations, charts, and diagrams with ease. Our dynamic, international team values creativity, collaboration, and technical excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Working Student in our Academics team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will support the day-to-day operations and growth of thinkcell’s academic program. You will work on a broad range of tasks, from handling program requests and supporting outreach to coordinating workshops and improving processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our academic program gives students and professors free access to thinkcell and helps them develop practical skills in data visualization and storytelling. You will help us bring these opportunities to more universities, faculty members, and student clubs worldwide (find out more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.think-cell.com/en/order/academics&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;). We have big plans to grow the program significantly with the next years – and you can be apart of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support program operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Help manage our academic inbox, respond to student and faculty inquiries, and coordinate license requests, renewals, and extensions with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review new applications&lt;/strong&gt;: Research faculty members and institutions, assess eligibility against program guidelines, and prepare responses and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support academic outreach&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify relevant professors and student clubs, draft personalized outreach, and follow up with existing contacts to build engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate workshops&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with student clubs and faculty to schedule workshops, organize logistics, and keep contact information up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute across the team&lt;/strong&gt;: Support ongoing projects and ad hoc tasks, taking ownership of defined activities as you gain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be great for this position if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studies&lt;/strong&gt;: Currently enrolled in business, computer science, or a related field, with at least two years of university studies completed – undergraduate degree is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive and comfortable working independently, with strong problem-solving skills and a keen eye for detail. Well organized, reliable, and able to prioritize tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;: Proficient in Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Available for 20 hours per week, including at least two days per week at our headquarters in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentation experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience creating presentations in PowerPoint is a strong plus; familiarity with thinkcell is an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Thinking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We embrace change and challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We take pride in our work and learn from our mistakes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer First&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We prioritize delivering lasting value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unified Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We foster collaboration, respect, and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strive for Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We set ambitious goals and pursue quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe in a human hiring process, every application is personally reviewed.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why is thinkcell the right place for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We empower over 1.3 million users across 35,000 companies, including top consulting firms and major global enterprises. With offices in Berlin, Munich, Denver, Boston, London, Tokyo, and Dubai, we’re a diverse team of over 240 people, committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;thinkcell is more than a job – it&#39;s a chance to be part of an innovative, inclusive team that values collaboration and growth. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. Together, we can shape the future of productivity software. We can’t wait to see what you’ll bring to the team!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As (Senior) Site Financial Controller (f/m/d/x) you will be part of the Controlling and FP&amp;amp;A team responsible for Factor EU. Our Team is tasked with safeguarding and owning the financial health of the companies operating in Germany, Belgium, Netherlands, Denmark and Sweden. Specifically, they are focused on everything in and around the P&amp;amp;L. We maintain and drive a by-annual budget cycle, serve as active business partners to the operations teams, and execute an impeccable and audit-proof financial closing round each month end. The team strives for continuous improvement in all financial and operational processes and is expected to proactively move the business forward on its profitable growth trajectory. You are responsible for all things finance at our production site in Verden. The role is broad and demanding and therefore requires excellent fundamentals in operational controlling, management accounting, and financial accounting. This position reports to the Head of Finance of Factor EU. The role can be based out of the site in Verden or Hybrid, based in our offices in Berlin. If hybrid, regular visits at the site are mandatory (~20%).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your area of responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own the weekly and monthly financial reporting for F_EU warehousing and production operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own the month end closing cycle for the operations, starting with accruals and finishing with high quality variance analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work with the Finance team and the fulfillment teams at the site to prepare and ensure quality inventory records&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You execute the quarterly and annual business planning for both production sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You execute long-term scenario analyses and forecasting as it relates to site operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You serve as a reliable finance business partner to F_EU finance leadership, the production site leadership, site HR departments and the global production leadership.&amp;nbsp;You challenge, sensitize and support workforce staffing and compensation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You continuously improve the processes that stand behind all aspects of F_EU operations financial reporting, budgeting and controlling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a university degree in STEM-related fields, Business Administration, Finance or Economics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have gained a minimum 3+ years of experience in a similar operations - finance controlling role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know your way around a P&amp;amp;L and are highly fluent in financial and management accounting topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong financial modeling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a great interest in operational processes and their impact on financial outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at business partnering through strong communication, organization, and a hands-on mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to solve problems in a structured and transparent way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are based out of Verden or with an ability to travel regularly via train&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deadlines do not bother you, but rather motivate you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL skills are a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior touchpoints with Adaptive and Oracle are a plus but not required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English, German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Internal training opportunities plus a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food &amp;amp; Lifestyle: &lt;/strong&gt;Discounts on Factor_-boxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary and 30 days of vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being: &lt;/strong&gt;Access to well-being initiatives, with discounted fitness offers currently being rolled out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re working on introducing additional perks, including mobility support and a company pension scheme, to give our team even more flexibility and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for a challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now with your complete application documents, also without a photo and without stating specific personal characteristics such as nationality or gender if you choose to do so. German or English language certificates and documents regarding residence and work permits are welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to hearing from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#factor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is reorganising UX to work AI-native — practitioners either go deep as platform and skills experts, or broad as generalists who move fluidly across product, design and engineering to drive experience quality and innovation. This role leads UX for our Operations organisation: the part of the business that bridges technology with physical fulfilment, procurement, quality assurance and supply chain, across every market and brand we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll take over from a Director who spent two years shifting this function from reactive delivery to a high-leverage, AI-native strategic partner — including building an internal design platform, integrated with AI tooling, that other parts of the business have since adopted. You inherit that trajectory, not a finished product: some of our highest-stakes bets for 2026, including how we plan menus algorithmically at scale and how we run the internal tools that power supply-chain decision-making, are still being actively designed, not maintained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Berlin-based, in-person leadership role. Operations is one of several major, Berlin-anchored parts of our technology organization, and regular physical presence — with peers, with your team, and in the room for cross-functional decisions — is a deliberate requirement of how we want this function led going forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX strategy and quality across four core areas of Operations: menu planning and food systems (algorithmic menu planning, ranking, demand forecasting, assortment), fulfillment (production, order management, inventory, logistics, manufacturing, supplier reliability), an internal operations-research platform that runs dozens of optimization models across the supply chain, and the technology backbone that keeps our warehouses and production sites running.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued build-out of an AI-native design practice: extending our design system directly into AI-assisted workflows, and using that as proof that UX can lead — not just support — the company&#39;s AI-first agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service design for the internal-facing tools that operators, planners and analysts depend on every day — often the least glamorous and highest-impact surface area in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent leadership for a distributed team spanning multiple geographies: hiring, career development, and consistent design-quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seat at the Operations leadership table, partnering directly with the senior Product and Engineering leaders for the organization, and representing UX&#39;s interests in company-wide strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in UX/product design, including several years leading design for complex, operational, or B2B/enterprise-grade systems — supply chain, logistics, marketplace operations, or similar domains are a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shifting a design function from reactive delivery to strategic, AI-native practice — not just familiarity with AI tools, but experience redesigning how a team works because of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling design systems/platforms that other teams adopt, and comfort operating at the intersection of design, product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management — this role sits at the table with senior product, engineering and exec leadership and needs to hold its own there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and unglamorous domains: this is service design for internal operators and planners, not consumer-facing polish, and the highest-value problems here are rarely the most visible ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location &amp;amp; ways of working&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in our Berlin office, with an expectation of regular in-person presence — this is one of the small number of senior UX roles at HelloFresh where onsite leadership is a deliberate requirement rather than a preference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reporting line&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to HelloFresh&#39;s VP of UX, who also leads UX for two other major parts of the business and reports into senior Product leadership. UX holds a more central, cross-functional reporting line than is typical for Product or Engineering here, reflecting the company&#39;s investment in design and experience quality as a differentiator — with visible sponsorship at the executive level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a new teammate to join us on the journey of keeping HelloFresh a trusted name - someone with a passion for security and appetite for new challenges. Security Engineers work in a variety of ways to constantly iterate and improve HelloFresh’s security posture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role aims to improve the HelloFresh Security Logging &amp;amp; Monitoring Program by maturing the tools, processes and playbooks to reduce dwell time (indicators of which would be lowered MTTD&amp;amp;R).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible&lt;/strong&gt; for SOC monitoring, use-case building, triage and advisory using cloud-native SIEM platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct&lt;/strong&gt; initial triage of security events and incidents and document progress throughout the Incident Response Lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate&lt;/strong&gt;, optimize, automate and operate modern security solutions like EDR/EPPs and conventional Firewalls, IDS/IPS, Email Security, VPN, and MDM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; premium and open-source threat intel feeds to regularly sweep environments against rising APT campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare&lt;/strong&gt; status reports and follow up with the stakeholders through Jira and Incident Mgmt. Platform to close the remediation loop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate&lt;/strong&gt; efficient Incident Detection and Response in &lt;strong&gt;AWS cloud &lt;/strong&gt;and enterprise IT environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 3 years of experience working in mature SOC environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security monitoring and incident response experience in AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud SIEM &amp;amp; SOAR platforms, DDoS mitigation and preventing tools and Layer-7 Web-based perimeter security controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of network intrusion methods, network containment, segregation techniques and technologies such as Sandboxes and Intrusion Detection/Prevention Systems (ID/PS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate EDR, EPP and Device Management solutions as per best security practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decent programming skills to enable data processing, IaC and security automations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and reporting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with log analysis stacks like ElasticSearch, Splunk/SumoLogic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to working on-call in rotational shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interacting with front-end developers, designers, product managers and our teams around the world is very much part of our day-to-day, so communication skills are vital. We are looking for strong problem-solvers who can apply their engineering skills to a wide range of platforms and environments, while also acting as an ambassador to coach team members and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a new teammate to join us on the journey of keeping HelloFresh a trusted name - someone with a passion for security and appetite for new challenges. Security Engineers work in a variety of ways to constantly iterate and improve HelloFresh’s security posture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the first port of call for responding to any of HelloFresh’s security related questions and concerns. You will also develop and deliver tools and processes to enable colleagues to achieve their goals and objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhance&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;the security posture of the enterprise IT infrastructure, services, and tools by hardening them against abuse and nefarious activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;secure configurations and policies for IAM, EDR, VPN, Firewalls, Email Security, Slack and MDM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;for security hardening and posture of enterprise IT assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adapt&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;to modern AI adoption strategy through implementing and mitigating AI controls in a variety of methods including Shadow AI, MCP integrations, and protecting against AI-based risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deploy, optimize and operate&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;modern security solutions like EDR, Zero-Trust, SSE/CASB, DLP, and Patch Management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assist&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;in company-wide security awareness campaigns and vulnerability patching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perform&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;comparative technical and commercial analysis for various security products/tools prior to procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience hardening workstations, network equipment, servers, IAM platforms through using CIS/NIST frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and usage of Generative AI from a corporate perspective, including LLM guardrails, MCP connections/gateways, and risks stemming from its usage such as prompt injections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform malware analysis on Windows, MacOS, and Linux machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of modern-day social engineering attacks and how to prevent them through technical controls and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of common TCP/IP protocols and modern-day security threats on each network layer and protecting against them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and reporting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
