&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Düsseldorf, Frankfurt (Hybrid) | Practice Area: Insurance | Type: Permanent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestalte mit uns die Zukunft der Versicherungsbranche – von neuen Geschäftsmodellen und digitalen Prozessen bis hin zu modernen, AI-gestützten Arbeitsweisen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultant*/ Manager* - Insurance (m/w/d)&lt;/strong&gt; gestaltest Du gemeinsam mit uns die digitale Transformation führender Versicherungsunternehmen. Du unterstützt unsere Kunden dabei, ihre Prozesse und IT-Systeme weiterzuentwickeln und zukunftsfähig aufzustellen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dabei gestaltest Du interessante Transformationsprojekte von der Strategie und Konzeption bis hin zur Umsetzung und verbindest fachliches Versicherungswissen mit technologischen Entwicklungen und neuen Markttrends. Hierfür bringst Du Dein fachliches Wissen, Dein IT-Verständnis sowie Deine Fähigkeit mit ein, Lösungen zu finden und zu gestalten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Für Deine Tätigkeit nutzt Du moderne und auf AI basierende Tools unter Berücksichtigung von ethischen und Sicherheitsgesichtspunkten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du gestaltest die digitale und AI-Transformation unserer Versicherungskunden mit Bezug auf Geschäftsmodelle, Prozesse und IT-Anwendungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du begleitest Projekte von der Strategie über die Planung bis hin zur Umsetzung und übernimmst hierbei die Rolle des Projekt-/Teilprojektleiters sowie des Fachberaters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du berätst Kunden bei Anforderungsanalyse und Lösungsgestaltung, bringst hierfür Deine versicherungstechnische Expertise ein, unterlegst sie mit dem notwendigen IT-Verständnis und konzipierst die Lösungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mit uns gemeinsam entwickelst Du innovative und praxisnahe Lösungen unter Nutzung geeigneter und freigegebener AI-Tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du beteiligst Dich an Projekt- und Kundenakquise, entwickelst unser Beratungsportfolio weiter und trägst damit zum Wachstum unserer Insurance Practice bei&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein Studium erfolgreich abgeschlossen, vorzugsweise in BWL/VWL, Informatik/Wirtschaftsinformatik oder einer vergleichbaren Fachrichtung, und bringst mind. 3 Jahre Berufserfahrung im Consulting oder Inhouse-Consulting von Versicherungen ein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über einen guten Überblick über die Versicherungstechnik und hast Dich in einem oder mehreren Themen in Vertrag oder Schaden vertieft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein grundlegendes Verständnis der Applikationslandschaft eines Versicherers und der darin abgebildeten Versicherungsprozesse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist in der Lage, die Fach- und IT-Anforderungen der Fach- und IT-Bereiche aufzunehmen, zu analysieren und zu hinterfragen, um daraus vollständige und passende Problembeschreibungen abzuleiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über für diese Aufgaben ausreichende IT-Kenntnisse, z. B. über Prozesse in der Software-Entwicklung bis hin zum Testing, Modellierung von Datenmodellen und Abläufen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist firm mit aktuellen Technologien und Markttrends und hast ein gutes Verständnis dafür, wie AI-Lösungen Geschäftsprozesse unterstützen können&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast Erfahrungen als Projekt- oder Teilprojektleiter und übernimmst die Verantwortung für die erwarteten Ergebnisse deines Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kommunizierst adressatengerecht und hast Spaß, Deine Ergebnisse intern und vor Vertretern von Kunden zu präsentieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift sowie praktische Erfahrung in einem deutschen Arbeitsumfeld&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast erste Erfahrungen gesammelt bei der Akquisition neuer Kunden als Teil von Sales-Teams und bei der Erstellung von Consulting- und Projektangeboten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum Capco?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestalte anspruchsvolle Transformationsprojekte für führende Unternehmen der Finanzdienstleistungsbranche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbeite in einer kollaborativen und unternehmerisch geprägten Beratungskultur mit flachen Hierarchien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entwickle Deine fachlichen und persönlichen Kompetenzen durch kontinuierliches Lernen und gezielte Weiterbildung weiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Übernimm Verantwortung und bringe Deine Expertise und Ideen aktiv in Kundenprojekte und die Weiterentwicklung unserer Insurance Practice ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestalte gemeinsam mit uns die Zukunft der Versicherungsbranche und ihrer digitalen Transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitsmodelle und hybrides Arbeiten je nach Projekteinsatz möglich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Umfassendes Onboarding sowie Dein persönlicher Coach und Buddy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike Leasing Programme sowie eine Capco Benefits Card mit monatlicher Gutschrift i.H.v. 44 EUR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regelmäßige Gesundheitschecks, Mental Health Kurse und Unterstützung durch den PME-Familienservice für unterschiedliche Lebenslagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kontinuierliches Feedback und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten, z. B. über interne Trainings und Udemy Business, sowie Firmenevents, ein internationales Arbeitsumfeld, flache Hierarchien und einen unbefristeten Arbeitsvertrag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inklusion bei Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir setzen uns für einen zugänglichen und unkomplizierten Recruiting-Prozess ein. Wenn Du in irgendeiner Phase Unterstützung oder Anpassungen benötigst, sprich uns gerne an. Wir schätzen unterschiedliche Perspektiven, Erfahrungen und Hintergründe. Bei Capco glauben wir daran, dass Individualität eine Stärke ist. Unsere #BeYourselfAtWork-Kultur fördert Vielfalt, Zusammenarbeit und ein Umfeld, in dem alle ihre individuellen Stärken einbringen können.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Wichtig ist nur, dass wir zueinander passen (m/w/d) #beyourselfatwork.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. With a buy-grow-and-hold-for-life approach and a permanent capital base, Banyan acquires and grows companies worldwide, honoring founder legacies and helping portfolio companies modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. Founded in 2016, Banyan operates more than 120 portfolio companies across North and South America, Europe, and APAC, and has appeared on the Inc. 5000 list for six consecutive years. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact opportunity to work directly alongside one of Banyan’s seasoned Operating Leaders, each overseeing a portfolio of software businesses in a buy, hold and grow investment model. As &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff&lt;/strong&gt;, you become a trusted right hand to your Operating Leader and a close working partner to the CEOs and functional leaders across their companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is deliberately broad. Rather than a fixed rotation, you will move across multiple operating companies and business problems: shaping a go-to-market plan for one company, improving customer onboarding at another, or standing up the first 100 days of a newly acquired business. You will gain exposure to software M&amp;amp;A, but the core of the job is hands-on value creation and operating work. You own initiatives end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Executive Leadership Program&lt;/strong&gt; (ELP) runs two years. Development is intentional. You will work through a range of experiences spanning go-to-market, M&amp;amp;A, customer, and finance priorities portfolio-wide, plus gain hands-on leadership reps, with regular check-ins and development opportunities to ready you for your next role. High performers move from the ELP program into a CEO or C-suite role within a Banyan operating company, or into a leadership role at Banyan Software HQ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For those who want to learn how great vertical software businesses are built and run, and who want the fastest path available to running one themselves, this is the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Gain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A cohort of high-calibre peers&lt;/strong&gt;. You grow and learn alongside other ELPs at Banyan, building a long-term network of future operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct apprenticeship with senior operators&lt;/strong&gt;. You will work very closely with an Operating Leader and see first-hand how experienced leaders make decisions across different software businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedicated development support&lt;/strong&gt;. External executive coaching in Year 2, plus mentorship from Operating Leaders with decades of software experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The fastest track we offer to running a business&lt;/strong&gt;. High performers move directly from this program into a C-suite seat inside a Banyan operating company or a leadership role at HQ. It is not guaranteed, performance decides placement, but it is the first place Banyan looks when those seats open and we have a strong track record of placing CEOs through our ELP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real operating reps, not case reps&lt;/strong&gt;. You carry a genuine initiative inside a live business and leadership-level stretch assignments, decisions that show up in a P&amp;amp;L.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Value Creation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with CEOs and functional leaders across multiple operating companies to identify priorities and implement the Banyan Operating System, turning strategy into measurable operational improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact, cross-functional projects across product, go-to-market, sales, marketing, pricing, and customer success as the right hand to Leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;A and Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to Banyan’s acquisition process, including value-creation plan framing during diligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integration planning and onboarding for newly acquired businesses, helping establish operating rhythms and priorities while respecting what already makes each business work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help execute the value-creation plan once a deal closes, turning the diligence thesis into the specific operating bets a business needs to win in year one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your Operating Leader on critical initiatives, executive decision-making, and cross-company collaboration, frequently influencing outcomes without formal authority or direct reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the judgment, breadth, and pattern recognition required for future general management by working different business problems across a portfolio of vertical software companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recently graduated from a top MBA program. This cycle is not open to first-year MBA students.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of pre-MBA experience in an operating role (product, business operations, portfolio operations, or value creation), management consulting, private equity, or investment banking, with a demonstrated record of owning measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and interpersonal judgment, with the ability to synthesize complex information and influence senior stakeholders without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High learning agility and comfort with ambiguity. You get smart quickly in unfamiliar areas, prioritize what matters, and move from analysis to action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego and high ownership. You are ambitious but humble, seek feedback, build trust quickly, and are motivated by the work of operating a business rather than by title.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in software, SaaS, or another recurring revenue business. Familiarity with vertical software economics is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a team. Direct people management is not required; this role initially relies on leadership through influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion &amp;amp; Equal Employment Opportunity at Banyan: Banyan affirms that inequality is detrimental to our Global Teams, associates, our Operating Companies, and the communities we serve. As a collective, our goal is to impact lasting change through our actions. Together, we unite for equality and equity. Banyan is committed to equal employment opportunities regardless of any protected characteristic, including race, color, genetic information, creed, national origin, religion, sex, affectional or sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, lawful alien status, ancestry, age, marital status, or protected veteran status and will not discriminate against anyone on the basis of a disability. We support an inclusive workplace where associates excel based on personal merit, qualifications, experience, ability, and job performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please Note&lt;/strong&gt;: Banyan Software does not accept unsolicited resumes or applications submitted via email, LinkedIn, or other direct channels. All candidates must apply through our official Careers site to be considered for employment. Applications submitted outside of our applicant tracking system will not be reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Banyan Software may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to assist in screening and/or assessing applicants during the recruitment process. All hiring decisions are made by our team. Personal information submitted through your application will be collected and used for recruitment purposes in accordance with applicable privacy laws. Contact us at any time with questions about our process or to request accommodation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beware of Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have been made aware of individuals fraudulently posing as members of our Talent Acquisition team and extending fake job offers. These scams may involve requests for personal information or payment for equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself by following these steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify that all communications from our recruiting team come from an ----- email address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remember, employers will &lt;strong&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt; request payment or banking information during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you receive a suspicious message, &lt;strong&gt;do not respond&lt;/strong&gt; — instead, forward it to &lt;a ---------- and/or report it to the platform where you received it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your safety and security are important to us. Thank you for staying vigilant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Klaviyo is a public company with more than $1.5 billion in annual revenue. Enterprise is our fastest growing segment, where global brands are consolidating their marketing and customer data onto Klaviyo and spending over seven figures a year with us. We have expanded beyond retail into hospitality, media, healthcare, and business services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will go after some of the largest brands in the world, including Fortune 500 and Global 2000 companies, prospecting your way in and taking full responsibility for your pipeline target.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most of these companies run separate tools for email, SMS, customer data, and service. We win by bringing it all onto one platform and getting the customer to results faster. Once they are live, you will keep growing the account and lead the renewal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospect your own territory.&lt;/strong&gt; Research every account, find a way in, and build relationships where Klaviyo has none today. BDR, marketing, and partner leads add to the pipeline you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the CEO of your territory.&lt;/strong&gt; Build a plan for every named account, create and prospect into a relationship map, and pull in solutions engineering, value management, partners, and marketing at the right time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run business-value discovery.&lt;/strong&gt; Find the real problem, put a number on it with the customer, and build a business case for the full platform that their finance team will support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell to the full buying committee.&lt;/strong&gt; Get to the CMO, CFO, CIO or CDO. Build champions and test them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win the competitive deals.&lt;/strong&gt; Displace the incumbent, hold your price, and have a clear answer on why Klaviyo and why now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close and forecast with discipline.&lt;/strong&gt; Run the mutual action plan, security and legal review, and procurement. Forecast against what the customer has agreed to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow and renew.&lt;/strong&gt; Expand into more products and teams, spot risk early, and negotiate renewals that make room for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in enterprise software sales, with 7+ years selling to C-level executives from a field sales position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven hunter who has built pipeline from scratch through your own research and outreach, and closed new logos from it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into organizations above $1B in revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of closing annual contracts of $1M or more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At or above quota in at least two of the last three years, on a multi-million dollar target&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex deals from start to finish, coordinating your internal team and the customer&#39;s decision makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running several complex deals that can last between nine and eighteen months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-product platform selling, with more than one product sold into the same account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of MEDDPICC and a value-based selling methodology, including building business cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain experience in MarTech, CDPs, customer engagement platforms, ecommerce, or an adjacent data platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner-led selling experience, and a record of winning competitive deals against existing platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience growing existing accounts through expansion and renewal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence, and fluency in CRM, forecasting, conversation intelligence, and AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires approximately 30 to 40 percent travel for customer meetings, executive briefings, partner work, and industry events.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labour in the country where the job post is advertised. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE&amp;nbsp; range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range in Local Currency:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£98,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£147,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By participating in Klaviyo’s interview process, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and will adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0auUcRqeYRczM9UoXAKldj&quot;&gt;Guidelines for using AI in the Klaviyo interview Process&lt;/a&gt;. For more information about how we process your personal data, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1axMoReIM1qwTbmaPcLI_b&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Klaviyo is committed to a policy of equal opportunity and non-discrimination. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, ethnicity, citizenship, national origin, color, religion or religious creed, age, sex (including pregnancy), gender identity, sexual orientation, physical or mental disability, veteran or active military status, marital status, criminal record, genetics, retaliation, sexual harassment or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;1737752197.414839&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1737752197.414839&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__background p-message_pane_message__message c-message_kit__message&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_container&quot; data-qa-unprocessed=&quot;false&quot; data-qa-placeholder=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__hover&quot; data-qa-hover=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
